 each keyword group\n3. Deduplicate and keep top 15-20 results\n4. Read the notes\n5. Write the answer\n\nLet me break the question into semantic segments and search. The question covers many acceleration methods:\n- MoE: sparse gating, top-k optimization, quantization, distillation\n- DiT: step distillation, consistency models, quantization, token merging\n- Multimodal: modality pruning, modality sparsification, quantization, distillation\n- Video: frame skipping, selective frame inference, token merging, quantization\n- General: KV-cache compression, early-exit, speculative decoding\n\nLet me create keyword groups and search in parallel across the four directories.\n\nLet me start with the searches. I'll organize by acceleration method categories:\n\n1. Sparse gating / MoE routing optimization\n2. Quantization (INT8/FP8/INT4/NF4) for MoE/DiT/Multimodal/Video\n3. Knowledge distillation\n4. KV-cache compression\n5. Token merging (ToMe)\n6. Early-exit / dynamic depth\n7. Speculative decoding\n8. Step distillation / consistency models (DiT)\n9. Modality pruning\n10. Frame skipping / selective frame (Video)\n11. Hardware adaptation (Tensor Core utilization, memory bandwidth)\n\nLet me search in parallel. I'll do multiple searches at once.","signature":"c04858f6-af44-4dc8-8825-52e6e595eb34"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":23843,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":19968,"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f9feddd1-2840-4e69-b7d6-77bf2876f400","uuid":"a86e9052-9e90-4898-bfb0-d8860b7567ec"}
