{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_01_Frua4cOYkBBF9sBw7c7a5280","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":{\"mode\":\"omnisearch\",\"hits\":[{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Speculative Decoding.md\",\"basename\":\"Speculative Decoding\",\"score\":4483.2241341262215,\"foundWords\":[\"speculative\",\"decoding\",\"draft\",\"draft_tokens.append\",\"draft_tokens\",\"model\",\"model；\",\"model）在一次前向中并行验证这些\",\"model，通过减少激活\",\"target\",\"verification\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":70},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":82},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":150},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":156},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":187},{\"match\":\"model）在一次前向中并行验证这些\",\"offset\":194},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":222},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":236},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":243},{\"match\":\"Draft\",\"offset\":326},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":332},{\"match\":\"Target\",\"offset\":360},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":367},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":434},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":442},{\"match\":\"Draft\",\"offset\":546},{\"match\":\"Draft\",\"offset\":567},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":573},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":581},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":588},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":636},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":654},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":712},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":770},{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":857},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":869},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":942},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":948},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":959},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":966},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":977},{\"match\":\"Draft\",\"offset\":1013},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":1049},{\"match\":\"draft_tokens\",\"offset\":1060},{\"match\":\"draft_tokens\",\"offset\":1119},{\"match\":\"draft_tokens.append\",\"offset\":1141},{\"match\":\"Verification\",\"offset\":1177},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":1213},{\"match\":\"draft_tokens\",\"offset\":1247},{\"match\":\"draft_tokens\",\"offset\":1403},{\"match\":\"Draft\",\"offset\":1599},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":1605},{\"match\":\"Draft\",\"offset\":1653},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":1659},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":1674},{\"match\":\"model；\",\"offset\":1681},{\"match\":\"Target\",\"offset\":1691},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":1698},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1727},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":1733},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1757},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":1763},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":1775},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1810},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1824},{\"match\":\"model，通过减少激活\",\"offset\":1830}],\"excerpt\":\"## Speculative Decoding\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSpeculative Decoding (SD, Leviathan et al., 2023) 是一种 LLM 推理加速技术。核心思想：用一个较小/较快的 draft model 自回归生成多个候选 token，然后由原始大模型（target model）在一次前向中并行验证这些 token。如果 draft token 与 target model 的预测一致（acceptance rate 高），则等效于一次前向生成了多个 token，实现 wall-c…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/MLC-LLM for Speculative Decoding（MLC-LLM 投机解码推理）.md\",\"basename\":\"MLC-LLM for Speculative Decoding（MLC-LLM 投机解码推理）\",\"score\":4188.326573633109,\"foundWords\":[\"speculative\",\"decoding\",\"decoding（mlc-llm\",\"draft\",\"draft/verify\",\"model\",\"target\",\"verification\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Decoding（MLC-LLM\",\"offset\":27},{\"match\":\"speculative\",\"offset\":291},{\"match\":\"decoding\",\"offset\":303},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":497},{\"match\":\"verification\",\"offset\":532},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":555},{\"match\":\"Model\",\"offset\":731},{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":989},{\"match\":\"Draft\",\"offset\":1006},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1061},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":1136},{\"match\":\"draft/verify\",\"offset\":1383},{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":1744},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":1756}],\"excerpt\":\"## MLC-LLM for Speculative Decoding（MLC-LLM 投机解码推理）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nMLC-LLM（https://github.com/mlc-ai/mlc-llm）是一个通用的 LLM 推理和部署框架，支持多种硬件后端（CUDA、ROCm、Metal、Vulkan、WebGPU）和模型架构。其核心特色是基于 Apache TVM 的编译优化——通过机器学习编译技术将模型自动编译为针对目标硬件的优化代码。\\n在 MagicDec 论文中，MLC-LLM 被用作为 speculative decoding 的第二…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Speculative Decoding for Long Context (长上下文投机解码).md\",\"basename\":\"Speculative Decoding for Long Context (长上下文投机解码)\",\"score\":4167.492469117136,\"foundWords\":[\"speculative\",\"decoding\",\"decoding（sd，投机解码）是一种\",\"draft\",\"draft、target\",\"draft（使用压缩\",\"draft_tokens.append\",\"draft_tokens\",\"draft_tok\",\"model\",\"target\",\"verification\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":98},{\"match\":\"Decoding（SD，投机解码）是一种\",\"offset\":110},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":158},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":164},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":187},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":194},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":257},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":264},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":546},{\"match\":\"draft、target\",\"offset\":582},{\"match\":\"verification\",\"offset\":961},{\"match\":\"Draft（使用压缩\",\"offset\":1102},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1237},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1273},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1335},{\"match\":\"draft_tokens.append\",\"offset\":1385},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1430},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1467},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1476},{\"match\":\"draft_tokens\",\"offset\":1577},{\"match\":\"draft_tokens\",\"offset\":1641},{\"match\":\"draft_tok\",\"offset\":1842},{\"match\":\"draft_tokens\",\"offset\":1865},{\"match\":\"draft_tok\",\"offset\":1891},{\"match\":\"draft_tok\",\"offset\":1951},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":2037},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":2184},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":2190},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":2199},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":2206},{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":2655},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":2667}],\"excerpt\":\"## Speculative Decoding for Long Context (长上下文投机解码)\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSpeculative Decoding（SD，投机解码）是一种 lossless 的 LLM 解码加速算法：使用轻量 draft model 快速生成 γ 个候选 token，target model 通过一次并行 forward pass 验证所有候选，通过 greedy matching 或概率接受保证输出与 target model 原生 AR 解码完全一致。标准 SD 的加速比公式为：\\n$$\\\\f…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/系统知识笔记/Token Budget in Speculative Decoding Serving（投机解码推理中的Token预算）.md\",\"basename\":\"Token Budget in Speculative Decoding Serving（投机解码推理中的Token预算）\",\"score\":3658.4906970332936,\"foundWords\":[\"speculative\",\"decoding\",\"draft\",\"model\",\"target\",\"verification\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":19},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":31},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":123},{\"match\":\"verification\",\"offset\":134},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":201},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":207},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":799},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":805},{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":913},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":925}],\"excerpt\":\"## Token Budget in Speculative Decoding Serving（投机解码推理中的Token预算）\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nToken Budget 在 AdaServe 中表示当前硬件在一次 target LLM verification 中可承载的最大 token 数。受 GPU 计算能力、当前 batch 大小、KV cache 可用空间和 draft model 计算资源约束。Token budget 是 SLO-customized token tree 构造问题的核心约束：所有请求 selected token tree 节点数之和不能超过此 budget。\\n从系统…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Speculative Decoding in MoE Offloading（MoE Offloading 中的投机解码）.md\",\"basename\":\"Speculative Decoding in MoE Offloading（MoE Offloading 中的投机解码）\",\"score\":3614.1275684405678,\"foundWords\":[\"speculative\",\"decoding\",\"draft\",\"model\",\"target\",\"target_model_hidden_state\",\"verification\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":3},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":15},{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":88},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":100},{\"match\":\"speculative\",\"offset\":147},{\"match\":\"decoding\",\"offset\":159},{\"match\":\"speculative\",\"offset\":368},{\"match\":\"decoding\",\"offset\":380},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":394},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":401},{\"match\":\"speculative\",\"offset\":509},{\"match\":\"decoding\",\"offset\":521},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":534},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":540},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":557},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":564},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":631},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":637},{\"match\":\"verification\",\"offset\":701},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":795},{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":890},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":902},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":946},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":952},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":971},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":978},{\"match\":\"Draft\",\"offset\":1014},{\"match\":\"target_model_hidden_state\",\"offset\":1150},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":1181},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":1188},{\"match\":\"Target\",\"offset\":1352},{\"match\":\"Model\",\"offset\":1359},{\"match\":\"Verification\",\"offset\":1365},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":1558},{\"match\":\"Draft\",\"offset\":1939},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":1945},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":1966},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":1973},{\"match\":\"speculative\",\"offset\":2039},{\"match\":\"decoding\",\"offset\":2051},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":2070},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":2077},{\"match\":\"verification\",\"offset\":2083},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":2133},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":2139},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":2208},{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":2311},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":2323}],\"excerpt\":\"## Speculative Decoding in MoE Offloading（MoE Offloading 中的投机解码）\\n术语是什么？通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nSpeculative Decoding in MoE Offloading 是 SpecMoEOff 提出的首个将 speculative decoding 应用于 MoE 模型 CPU-GPU offloading 推理场景的系统方法。核心动机：MoE offloading 中，CPU-GPU 的 expert weight 传输（I/O bottleneck）和 MoE 的稀疏激活导致 GPU 利用率极低——batch=…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Computation Reordering for MoE Verification（MoE验证阶段计算重排序）.md\",\"basename\":\"Computation Reordering for MoE Verification（MoE验证阶段计算重排序）\",\"score\":2911.8824470691065,\"foundWords\":[\"speculative\",\"decoding\",\"draft\",\"model\",\"target\",\"verification\",\"verification（moe验证阶段计算重排序）\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Verification（MoE验证阶段计算重排序）\",\"offset\":34},{\"match\":\"Verification\",\"offset\":137},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":200},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":207},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":974},{\"match\":\"Speculative\",\"offset\":1104},{\"match\":\"Decoding\",\"offset\":1126}],\"excerpt\":\"## Computation Reordering for MoE Verification（MoE验证阶段计算重排序）\\n术语是什么？回答尽量完整，回答逻辑链中每一步都解释出来。通过联网搜索让回答具体和精准。\\nComputation Reordering for MoE Verification 是 MoE-SpeQ Execution Engine 在 verify 阶段的内存局部性优化：在 target model 并行验证 k 个草稿 tokens 前，分析 ELB 按 expert_id 将 tokens 重新分组排序，使分配给同一 expert 的 tokens 连续计算。Expert weights 加载到 GPU cache 后由所有需要该 e…\"},{\"filename\":\"knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/CPU Chunked Attention Verification Kernel（CPU 分块注意力验证 Kernel）.md\",\"basename\":\"CPU Chunked Attention Verification Kernel（CPU 分块注意力验证 Kernel）\",\"score\":2795.0837696374897,\"foundWords\":[\"speculative\",\"decoding\",\"draft\",\"draft-to-prefix\",\"draft-to-draft\",\"model\",\"target\",\"verification\"],\"matches\":[{\"match\":\"Verification\",\"offset\":25},{\"match\":\"Verification\",\"offset\":110},{\"match\":\"speculative\",\"offset\":145},{\"match\":\"decoding\",\"offset\":157},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":260},{\"match\":\"speculative\",\"offset\":320},{\"match\":\"decoding\",\"offset\":332},{\"match\":\"verification\",\"offset\":341},{\"match\":\"target\",\"offset\":402},{\"match\":\"model\",\"offset\":409},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"offset\":505},{\"match\":\"draft\",\"of