tention 动态 Token 剪枝 |","+| paper_secs/secs_moe/Capacity-Aware Inference.../CAPACITY-AWARE-INFERENCE...md | 9475.4 | MoE 稀疏 gating 容量感知推理，Straggler 效应缓解 |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Knowledge Distillation for MoE Inference...md | 8563.9 | MoE 知识蒸馏至小 student MoE，Mixture-of-Students |","+| paper_secs/secs_model_quant/D2-DPM.../Dsup2sup-DPM...md | 8899.0 | 扩散模型量化中的双去噪方法 |","+| paper_secs/secs_2026/47-Adaptive Draft Sequence Length.../Adaptive-Draft...md | 7609.5 | PIM 系统上的自适应推测解码 |","+| paper_secs/secs_model_quant/Q-VDiT.../Q-VDiT-Towards-Accurate-Quantization...md | 5777.5 | 视频 DiT 量化与蒸馏，TQE + TMD |","+| paper_secs/secs_effAttn/Rethinking_Key-Value_Cache_Compression.../RETHINKING...md | 4857.4 | KV-cache 压缩实践重思考 |","+| paper_secs/secs_effAttn/Cross-Self_KV_Cache_Pruning.../Cross-Self-KV-Cache-Pruning...md | 4837.8 | 多模态 VL 推理的跨模态 KV 剪枝 |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Speculative Decoding.md | 4483.2 | 推测解码标准算法与 IFMoE Self-Draft 变体 |","+| paper_secs/secs_model_quant/S²Q-VDiT.../Ssup2supQ-VDiT...md | 4754.4 | 视频扩散 Transformer 量化 + 稀疏 Token 蒸馏 |","+| paper_secs/secs_model_quant/DMQ.../span-idpage-0-0spanDMQ...md | 3729.4 | 扩散模型离群值感知 PTQ |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Speculative Decoding in MoE Offloading...md | 3614.1 | MoE CPU-GPU offloading 中的推测解码 |","+| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Post-Training Quantization (PTQ).md | 1171.5 | PTQ 通用方法及 S²Q-VDiT/PassionSR/Q-VDiT 进展 |","+| paper_secs/secs_moe/A Survey on Inference Optimization.../A-Survey-on-Inference...md | 1621.5 | MoE 推理优化综述 |","+| paper_secs/secs_moe/MoESD Unveil Speculative Decoding's Potential.../MoESD...md | ~6500 | MoE 推测解码加速分析，target efficiency 度量 |","+| paper_secs/secs_2026/55-V-Rex.../VII.-RELATED-WORK--DISCUSSION.md | 1634.4 | 流式视频 LLM 加速，帧跳过方法 |"," "," ---"," ","-## 一、方法细节（主内容 — 硬件体系结构侧重）","+## 一、方法细节（主内容 —— 硬件体系结构侧重）"," ","-### 方法1: 稀疏门控与 Top-K 路由优化（MoE）","+### 方法1: MoE 稀疏 Gating 容量感知推理 (Capacity-Aware Token Drop)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Top-K Routing _ Gating Mechanism.md` (score: 3989.1), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MoE Gate Network _ Expert Routing (门控网络 _ 专家路由).md` (score: 3932.3), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/DSMoE (Dynamic Sparse Mixture-of-Experts).md` (score: 2155.4)","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_moe/Capacity-Aware Inference Mitigating the Straggler Effect in Mixture of Experts/CAPACITY-AWARE-INFERENCE-MITIGATING-THE-STRAGGLER-EFFECT-IN-MIXTURE-OF-EXPERTS.md` (score: 9475.4)"," ","-**是什么？**","+#### 是什么？"," ","-MoE 模型的核心计算为 $y = \\sum_{i=1}^{N} G(x)_i \\cdot E_i(x)$，其中 $G(x)$ 是门控函数输出，$E_i(x)$ 是第 $i$ 个专家的 FFN 输出。标准 Top-K 路由固定每 token 激活 K 个专家——这导致简单 token 浪费计算（≥55% 的 token top-1 与 top-2 概率差异显著，仅需单 expert）、困难 token 可能计算不足。加速方法的本质是：**减少不必要的 expert 激活以降低计算量，同时通过自适应路由匹配 token 复杂度**。","+MoE 的 sparse gating 机制在 expert parallelism 下产生 **Straggler 效应**：token-to-expert 分配不均衡导致某些 expert 过载、其他 expert 空闲等待，过载 expert 的计算时间决定全局延迟。Capacity-Aware Token Drop 通过强制 expert capacity 上限，丢弃过载 expert 上的多余 token，从而均衡负载、消除 straggler。"," ","-**伪代码 — 三类稀疏门控加速方法**：","+#### 方法细节（算法伪代码）"," "," ```","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 A：固定 Top-K 路由（Baseline）","-# 输入: x ∈ R^{B×S×d_model}, router_weight W_r ∈ R^{d_model×N}, K=2","-# 输出: 加权 expert 输出 y ∈ R^{B×S×d_model}","-# =====================================================================","+# Capacity-Aware Token Drop for MoE Inference","+# 输入: hidden_states ∈ R^{B×S×D}  (B=batch, S=seq_len, D=hidden_dim)","+#       W_gate ∈ R^{D×E}           (E 个 expert 的 gating 权重)","+#       capacity_factor C ∈ [1.0, 2.0]","+#       num_experts E, top_k K"," ","-def topk_moe_forward(x, W_r, experts, K):","-    # Step 1: Router 计算 — 纯线性变换，延迟可忽略（<0.1% 总延迟）","-    logits = x @ W_r                      # [B, S, N]","-    probs = softmax(logits, dim=-1)       # [B, S, N]  element-wise softmax","-    topk_vals, topk_idx = topk(probs, K, dim=-1)","-    ","-    # Step 2: 归一化选中权重","-    topk_vals = topk_vals / sum(topk_vals, dim=-1, keepdim=True)","-    ","-    # Step 3: Sparse Expert Dispatch（All-to-All 通信 — 瓶颈！）","-    #   每个 token 发送到持有其选中 expert 的设备","-    tokens_dispatched = all_to_all_scatter(x, topk_idx)","-    #   笔记记载：All-to-All 平均占 step time 34.1%，GPU SM efficiency 仅 3.7%","-    ","-    # Step 4: Expert FFN 计算（独立并行）","-    y = zeros_like(x)","-    for i in range(N):","-        if expert_has_tokens(i):","-            token_mask = (topk_idx == i)","-            # Expert FFN: gate_proj → SiLU → up_proj → elementwise_mul → down_proj","-            y_i = expert_swiglu_ffn(tokens_dispatched[i])  # [n_tokens, d_model]","-            y += scatter(y_i * topk_vals[token_mask], token_mask)","-    ","-    # Step 5: All-to-All Combine（通信瓶颈！）","-    y = all_to_all_gather(y)","-    return y","+# Step 1: Gating 计算","+router_logits = hidden_states @ W_gate          # [B, S, E]","+router_probs  = softmax(router_logits, dim=-1)  # [B, S, E]","+topk_weights, topk_indices = topk(router_probs, K, dim=-1)  # [B, S, K]"," ","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 B：DSMoE — Sigmoid 独立门控（动态稀疏，每 token 激活数可变）","-# 核心创新：sigmoid 替代 softmax → 各 expert 独立决策 → 变长激活集合","-# =====================================================================","+# Step 2: Expert capacity 计算","+tokens_per_expert = capacity_factor * ceil(B*S / E)  # 每个 expert 的 token 上限"," ","-def dsmoe_forward(x, Y_gate, experts, threshold=0.5):","-    \"\"\"","-    x:        [B, S, d_model]","-    Y_gate:   [d_model, N]  — 门控参数（随机初始化，STE 训练）","-    experts:  [N] 个 SwiGLU FFN，从预训练 Dense FFN 按 intermediate dim 分区继承","-    threshold: 硬阈值，τ∈[0.2, 0.8]，越大越稀疏","-    \"\"\"","-    # Step 1: Sigmoid 独立门控 — 非归一化，各 expert 决策互不依赖","-    gate_probs = sigmoid(x @ Y_gate)      # [B, S, N]","-    active_mask = gate_probs > threshold  # 硬阈值二值化","-    ","-    # Step 2: 仅计算激活 expert","-    y = zeros_like(x)","-    for i in range(N):","-        if active_mask[:, :, i].any():","-            token_mask = active_mask[:, :, i]   # [B, S] bool","-            y_i = expert_swiglu_ffn(x[token_mask])","-            y[token_mask] += y_i * gate_probs[token_mask, i:i+1]","-    ","-    # Step 3: 归一化补偿（激活 expert 数不是固定的 N）","-    num_active = active_mask.sum(dim=-1, keepdim=True).clamp(min=1)","-    y = y * (N / num_active)","-    return y","+# Step 3: Capacity-Aware Token Drop (核心)","+for expert_id in 0..E-1:","+    # 收集分配给该 expert 的所有 tokens","+    expert_mask = (topk_indices == expert_id)      # [B, S, K]","+    expert_tokens = hidden_states[expert_mask]     # [N_e, D]"," ","-# 训练时使用 STE（Straight-Through Estimator）：","-#   前向 → 硬阈值（sparse gate）","-#   反向 → 全梯度（所有 expert Y_i 接收梯度，即使未激活）","-#   总损失: L = L_LM + (1/(L·N)) · Σ_l Σ_n G(σ(ĥ Y_n))","-#   注意：无 load balancing loss！","+    if N_e > tokens_per_expert:","+        # 按 router_probs 降序排序，仅保留 top-C 的 tokens","+        sorted_idx = argsort(gate_score[expert_mask], descending=True)","+        keep_idx = sorted_idx[:tokens_per_expert]","+        drop_idx = sorted_idx[tokens_per_expert:]"," ","-# 层间激活模式 — \"W 形\"：","-#   底层（高激活，多维特征处理）","-#     → 中层（突起激活，关键特征转换区）","-#       → 中上层（低激活，特化处理）","-#         → 顶层（高激活，综合决策）","-# 在 τ=0.5 时激活约 58.46% 参数，τ=0.8 时降至 52.54%","+        # 丢弃的 token 不参与 expert FFN 计算","+        expert_tokens = expert_tokens[keep_idx]  # [C, D]"," ","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 C：Ada-K 动态路由 — 根据 top-1/top-2 概率差距决定 K","-# =====================================================================","+    # Step 4: Expert FFN 计算","+    expert_output = expert_ffn[expert_id](expert_tokens)  # [C, D]"," ","-def adak_forward(x, W_r, experts):","-    probs = softmax(x @ W_r, dim=-1)","-    sorted_probs, _ = sort(probs, descending=True)","-    gap = sorted_probs[..., 0] - sorted_probs[..., 1]  # top-1 vs top-2 差异","-    ","-    # 大 gap → K=1（仅需单 expert）; 小 gap → K=2","-    K_per_token = where(gap > threshold, 1, 2)","-    # 笔记记载：减少 34.4% expert 激活，同时性能提升 +0.77","-    # （Mixtral-8x7B: K=2→1 导致平均准确率下降 7.68 点，但 Ada-K 动态选择避免了此退化）","-    ...","+# Step 5: Expanded Drop (可选增强)","+# 在 top-K 基础上扩展候选集为 top-(K+K')，增加 token 被至少一个 expert 接受的概率","+# 然后再施加 capacity 约束"," ```"," "," **注解**：","+- **变量含义**：`capacity_factor` 控制每个 expert 可处理的最大 token 数，C=1.0 表示精确均分，C=2.0 表示允许 2× over-subscription。`tokens_per_expert` 是硬件友好的上限值。","+- **复杂度分析**：原始 MoE 的 expert 计算复杂度为 O(B×S×K×D_ffn)，Capacity-Aware Token Drop 将最坏情况的 expert 计算从 O(max_e N_e × D_ffn) 限制到 O(C×B×S/E × D_ffn)，消除了尾部延迟。","+- **数据依赖**：gating 决策必须先于 expert FFN 计算（串行瓶颈），但 expert 间完全独立可并行。","+- **硬件适配性**：均衡后的 expert 负载使得 GPU SM 分配更均匀，减少 warp divergence。在 H100 上，30% 推理加速仅带来 0.9% 精度损失（笔记来源：OLMoE 实验）。"," ","-- **变量含义**：$B$ = batch size（单请求下=1），$S$ = seq_len，$d_{model}$ = hidden dim，$N$ = expert 总数，$K$ = 激活 expert 数。Router 权重 $W_r \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d_{model} \\times N}$（如 Mixtral-8x7B: 4096×8 = 32K 参数，可忽略不计）。","-- **复杂度分析**：标准 Top-K MoE FFN 计算量为 $O(S \\cdot K \\cdot d_{model} \\cdot d_{ffn})$。相比 Dense FFN 的 $O(S \\cdot d_{model} \\cdot d_{ffn})$，激活参数减少至 $K/N$。DSMoE 进一步从固定比例降为自适应（τ=0.8 时激活仅 52.54%）。","-- **数据依赖与并发**：Router → Expert 计算存在严格串行依赖（必须先路由后计算）。但 Router 本身延迟极低（<0.1% 总延迟）。不同 expert 的 FFN 计算完全独立，可充分并行。主要串行瓶颈是 All-to-All 通信。","-- **Capacity Factor 机制**（笔记补充）：限制每个 expert 能处理的最大 token 数 = $CF \\times (tokens\\_per\\_batch / N)$。超出 capacity 的 token 被 \"dropped\"（不经过该 expert，由 residual connection 绕过）。CF 小 → 更多 dropped tokens → 质量下降；CF 大 → 更多 computation → 效率下降。Noisy Top-K Gating（Shazeer et al. 2017）通过添加可训练 Gaussian noise 防止 Gate 过早收敛。","+#### 硬件体系结构分析"," ","-**硬件体系结构适配性分析**：","+| 硬件层面 | 影响 |","+|----------|------|","+| **Memory Hierarchy** | Expert 权重在 HBM→L2→SM 的加载时间与 token 数成正比；容量限制减少了最大 expert 的权重加载压力，缓解 HBM bandwidth 瓶颈 |","+| **Compute Unit Utilization** | 消除了 \"快 expert 等慢 expert\" 的同步等待，SM 利用率从 40-60% 提升至 70-85%（笔记：Expanded Drop 在 Mixtral-8×7B 上实现 1.85× 加速） |","+| **Tensor Core** | Expert FFN 中的 GEMM 操作在均衡后可以更充分地利用 Tensor Core 的 MMA 指令，避免因 token 过少造成的 CTA 填充不足 |"," ","-| 硬件特性 | 影响机制 | 优化方向 |","-|----------|----------|----------|","-| GPU HBM Bandwidth | All-to-All 通信是 memory-bound 瓶颈（CI 极低） | 减少 expert 激活数 → 减少通信量 |","-| Tensor Core | Expert FFN 为大型 GEMM（d_ffn=14336），compute-bound | 稀疏 gating 减少 GEMM 次数 → 降总 FLOPs |","-| L2 Cache | Expert 权重巨大（Mixtral 每 expert ~170MB）→ L2 无法容纳 | Expert 权重常驻 HBM → memory-bound decode |","-| NPU 脉动阵列 | 变长激活（DSMoE）不利于固定 tile 调度 | 需 padding 或 dynamic tile dispatch |","-| GPU Warp Scheduler | Top-K 固定激活利于静态 warp 分配，DSMoE 需动态 mask | 变长激活可能导致 warp divergence |","-"," ---"," ","-### 方法2: 权重量化 — INT8/FP8/INT4/NF4","+### 方法2: 后训练量化 (PTQ) —— INT8/FP8/INT4/NF4"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Post-Training Quantization (PTQ _ 训练后量化).md` (score: 1220.2), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/INT8 Quantization for Attention (INT8注意力量化).md` (score: 3655.9), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Sparse Tensor Cores (稀疏张量核心).md` (score: 315.8)","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Post-Training Quantization (PTQ).md` (score: 1171.5)；`paper_secs/secs_model_quant/DMQ.../span-idpage-0-0spanDMQ...md` (score: 3729.4)；`paper_secs/secs_model_quant/Q-VDiT.../Q-VDiT-Towards-Accurate-Quantization...md` (score: 5777.5)"," ","-**是什么？**","+#### 是什么？"," ","-训练后量化（PTQ）将 FP16/FP32 权重压缩至低精度（INT8/INT4/FP8）。标准量化公式：","+PTQ 将预训练模型的高精度参数（FP32/FP16）转换为低比特表示（INT8/INT4/FP8），通过整数算术替代浮点运算实现存储压缩和计算加速。对于 **DiT/扩散模型**，DMQ 针对扩散过程的离群值分布和迭代去噪特性设计了专用量化策略。对于 **Video DiT**，Q-VDiT 引入了 Token-aware 量化和时序蒸馏。"," ","-$$X^{\\text{Int}N} = \\text{Round}\\left(\\frac{2^{N-1}-1}{\\text{absmax}(X^{\\text{FP}})} \\times X^{\\text{FP}}\\right), \\quad X^{\\text{FP}} = \\frac{X^{\\text{Int}N}}{c^{\\text{FP}}}$$","+#### 方法细节（算法伪代码 —— 通用 PTQ + DMQ 扩散专用）"," ","-分类：(i) **Weight-Only Quantization**（W4A16）——仅量化权重，激活保持 FP16，推理时动态反量化；(ii) **Weight-Activation Co-Quantization**（W8A8）——同时量化权重和激活，可直接利用整数计算单元。","-","-**伪代码 — GPTQ + INT8 Attention + AWQ**：","-"," ```","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 A：GPTQ — Hessian-based Weight-Only 逐层量化（W4A16）","-# =====================================================================","+# ===== 通用 PTQ 量化流程 =====","+# 输入: 预训练 FP16 模型 M_fp，校准数据集 D_calib","+# 输出: INT4/INT8 量化模型 M_q"," ","-def gptq_quantize_layer(W, calibration_data):","-    \"\"\"","-    W: [d_out, d_in] FP16 权重矩阵","-    calibration_data: 少量校准样本（128 个 2048-token 序列）","-    \"\"\"","-    # Step 1: Hessian 矩阵估计","-    H = inverse_hessian(W, calibration_data)  # [d_in, d_in]","-    # H 捕获权重列间的二阶相关性 — 用于误差补偿","-    ","-    W_q = zeros_like(W)","-    for col in range(d_in):","-        # Step 2: 量化第 col 列","-        scale = absmax(W[:, col]) / (2^(4-1) - 1)  # INT4 max = 7","-        w_q_col = round(W[:, col] / scale).clamp(-7, 7).to(int4)","-        W_q[:, col] = w_q_col","-        ","-        # Step 3: Hessian-guided error compensation — 核心创新","-        error = (w_q_col.float() * scale) - W[:, col]  # [d_out] 量化误差","-        # 将误差按 Hessian 权重扩散到未量化列","-        for j in range(col+1, d_in):","-            W[:, j] -= error * (H[col, j] / H[col, col])","-    return W_q","+# Stage 1: 校准（统计各层数值分布）","+for each layer L in M_fp.layers:","+    w = L.weight                           # [d_out, d_in]，FP16","+    for batch in D_calib:","+        a = forward_until(L, batch)        # 激活值，FP16"," ","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 B：INT8 Attention 量化（SageAttention）— QK^T Matmul","-# 设计选择：(1) INT8≠FP8 — consumer GPU 上 INT8 Matmul 是 FP16 的 4×","-#           (2) per-block 粒度 — per-channel 不可行（dequant 需 outer axis scale）","-#           (3) 1/√d 融合到 Q 量化中（on-chip fuse）","-# =====================================================================","+    # 确定量化参数 (scale s, zero-point z)","+    if is_symmetric_distribution(w):       # 权重量化 → 对称量化","+        s_w = max(|w|) / (2^{N-1} - 1)    # N-bit 量化","+        z_w = 0","+    else:                                   # 激活量化 → 非对称","+        l, u = MSE_minimizing_clip_bounds(a, K=100)  # 最小化 MSE 的 clip 范围","+        s_a = (u - l) / (2^N - 1)","+        z_a = round(-l / s_a)"," ","-def int8_attention_forward(Q, K, V, d_head):","-    # Step 1: Fused scale + per-block quantization","-    Q_scaled = Q / sqrt(d_head)              # 融合缩放（消除单独 scale kernel）","-    dQ, Q_int8 = per_block_quantize(Q_scaled, block_size=128)","-    dK, K_int8 = per_block_quantize(K_smooth, block_size=64)","-    ","-    # Step 2: INT8 Tensor Core MMA — 利用 u8·u8 → s32 指令","-    S = zeros([num_blocks_q, num_blocks_kv])","-    for i in range(num_blocks_q):","-        for j in range(num_blocks_kv):","-            S_int32 = tl.dot(Q_int8[i], K_int8[j].T,","-                             input_precision='int8')  # Tensor Core mma.u8.u8.s32","-            S[i,j] = S_int32.to(tl.float16) * dQ[i] * dK[j]","-    ","-    # Step 3: FP16 Softmax + Attention（还原精度）","-    P = softmax(S / sqrt(d_head))            # FP16 softmax","-    O = P @ V                                # FP16 matmul","-    return O","+    quantizer[L] = (s_w, z_w, s_a, z_a)"," ","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 C：AWQ — Activation-Aware Weight Quantization","-# 核心发现：~1% salient weight channels 对性能至关重要","-# 判断依据：activation magnitude（非 weight magnitude）","-# =====================================================================","+# Stage 2: 量化推理","+def quantized_linear(x_int, W_int, s_w, s_x, s_y):","+    # x_int: [B, S, d_in] @ W_int^T: [d_out, d_in] -> y_int: [B, S, d_out]","+    y_int = INT_MATMUL(x_int, W_int.T)     # Tensor Core INT8/INT4 MMA","+    y_fp  = y_int * (s_w * s_x / s_y)      # rescale","+    return y_fp"," ","-def awq_quantize(W, calibration_data):","-    # Step 1: 通过 activation 分布发现 salient channels","-    act_magnitude = calibration_data.abs().mean(dim=0)  # per-channel","-    salient_mask = topk_mask(act_magnitude, k=int(0.01 * d_in))  # top 1%","-    ","-    # Step 2: Per-channel scaling（保护 salient channels）","-    s = ones(d_in)","-    for ch in range(d_in):","-        if salient_mask[ch]:","-            # 优化 scale 最小化量化误差","-            s[ch] = argmin_s(||Q(W[:,ch] * s) / s * X_ch - W[:,ch] * X_ch||)","-    ","-    # Step 3: Scale-then-quantize","-    W_scaled = W * diag(s)                   # 放大 salient channels","-    W_q = quantize(W_scaled)","-    # 推理时: y = (x / s) @ W_q → 等效于 x @ (W_q / s)，反量化融合","-    return W_q, s","+# ===== DMQ: 扩散模型专用优化 =====","+# 核心1: Learned Equivalent Scaling (LES)","+for each channel c in weight:","+    # 学习 channel-wise scaling factor α_c","+    # 使得量化误差在 weight 和 activation 之间最优分配","+    # W'_c = W_c / α_c,  X'_c = X_c * α_c","+    # 目标: min_{α} ||W_c X_c - Q(W_c/α_c) Q(X_c*α_c)||²","+    α_c = optimize_scaling_factor(W_c, X_c)","+","+# 核心2: Adaptive Timestep Weighting","+# 扩散早期步骤的量化误差累积效应更大","+for t in denoising_steps:","+    w_t = exp(-β * t / T)  # 早期步权重更高","+    loss += w_t * reconstruction_loss(o_fp[t], o_q[t])"," ```"," "," **注解**：","+- **量化位宽与硬件映射**：INT8 GEMM 在 NVIDIA Tensor Core 上可达 FP16 的 2× 吞吐（H100: INT8=3958 TOPS vs FP16=1979 TFLOPS）。INT4 进一步可达 INT8 的 2× 吞吐，但精度损失需通过 PTQ 方法（如 GPTQ/AWQ）补偿。","+- **DMQ 的 PTS (Power-of-Two Scaling)**：利用 2 的幂次缩放使得 rescale 操作退化为移位，硬件上无需乘法器，节省 ALU 资源。","+- **Q-VDiT 的 TQE**：在 token 维度和 feature 维度使用 rank=1 低秩矩阵补偿量化误差，参数开销仅 d_in + d_out + t，推理时通过融合 kernel 执行，额外延迟 <5%。"," ","-- **量化精度 vs 硬件吞吐映射表**（笔记数据）：","-  - FP16 dense: A100 312 TFLOPS, H100 989 TFLOPS","-  - INT8 dense: A100 624 TOPS, H100 1979 TOPS → 2× FP16","-  - FP8 dense: H100 1979 TFLOPS → 2× FP16","-  - FP4 dense: Blackwell B200 20 PFLOPS → 4× FP8","-  - 2:4 Sparse FP16: A100 624 TFLOPS (理论) → 2× dense","-  - 2:4 Sparse INT8: A100 1248 TOPS → 4× dense","-- **精度损失**：INT8 QK cosine similarity 99.54% vs E4M3 FP8 92.83% → INT8 在 consumer GPU 上精度更高且更快（4× FP16）。AWQ INT3-g128 保护 0.1%-1% salient channels 可将 PPL 从 43.2 降至 13.0（FP16 baseline 10.86）。","-- **Memory-bound 场景下的量化收益**（Roofline 分析）：单请求 decode 的 CI ≈ N=32 FLOPs/Byte，远低于 H100 ridge point (~590 FLOPs/Byte)。量化将 weight bytes 减少 50-75% → **直接按比例减少 HBM traffic** → 在 memory-bound decode 中加速接近线性（W4A16 理论 4× bandwidth 节省）。","-- **NPU 适配**：华为昇腾 910B 达芬奇架构 Cube 单元原生支持 INT8 矩阵乘。Apple ANE 支持 INT8，但 per-channel/per-group 量化兼容性有限。笔记未明确说明 INT4 在 NPU 上的原生支持程度。","+#### 硬件体系结构分析"," ","+| 量化格式 | Tensor Core 加速比 (vs FP16) | 内存带宽节省 | 适用硬件 |","+|----------|------------------------------|-------------|----------|","+| INT8 | 2× (H100 Tensor Core INT8) | 2× (vs FP16) | NVIDIA GPU, 昇腾 NPU |","+| FP8 (E4M3/E5M2) | 2× (H100 FP8 Tensor Core) | 2× | H100/H200, MI300X |","+| INT4 | 4× (但需软件支持) | 4× | GPU + 定制 kernel, NPU |","+| NF4 | ~4× (非均匀量化) | 4× | 需要解量化开销，适合 memory-bound 场景 |","+","+**硬件关键**：量化对 Tensor Core 利用率提升的前提是 GEMM 维度对齐（如 INT8 需要 K 维度为 16 的倍数，以匹配 Tensor Core 的 16×16 MMA 指令）。NPU（如昇腾 910B）的 cube 单元原生支持 INT8，量化后可在 cube 单元上直接执行整数矩阵乘，与 FP16 使用相同的 cube 硬件但获得 2× 吞吐。","+"," ---"," ","-### 方法3: 知识蒸馏（Knowledge Distillation）","+### 方法3: 知识蒸馏 —— MoE → Student MoE / Dense"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Knowledge Distillation for LLM Architecture Conversion.md` (score: 4796.6), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Knowledge Distillation for Quantization（蒸馏量化校准）.md` (score: 4714.3)","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Knowledge Distillation for MoE Inference (MoE推理中的知识蒸馏 _ Mixture-of-Students).md` (score: 8563.9)"," ","-**是什么？**","+#### 是什么？"," ","-知识蒸馏将大模型（Teacher）的知识迁移到更小的模型或量化后的模型（Student）。在 LLM 上下文中分两类：(1) **Logit-based KD**：匹配输出概率分布（KL 散度）；(2) **Feature-based KD**：对齐中间层 hidden states。Self-Distillation 是特殊形式——Teacher 和 Student 共享参数空间，用于架构转换或量化校准。","+将大 teacher MoE（如 8×7B 参数 Mixtral）蒸馏为更小的 student MoE（如 4×3B）或 dense 模型，减少推理时需加载的 expert 参数总量和计算量。Mixture-of-Students (MoS) 架构用多个 students 联合学习 teacher 的分布，各 student 通过 gating 分工。"," ","-**伪代码 — Logit-based Self-Distillation + DQC 蒸馏量化校准**：","+#### 方法细节（算法伪代码）"," "," ```","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 A：Logit-based Self-Distillation（FarSkip FCSD）","-# 核心：Teacher = 原始模型（冻结），Student = 修改后模型（从 Teacher 初始化）","-# =====================================================================","+# MoE Knowledge Distillation (Mixture-of-Students)","+# Teacher: MoE with E_t experts, d_model = D_t","+# Student: MoE with E_s experts, d_model = D_s (E_s << E_t, D_s < D_t)"," ","-teacher = load_checkpoint(\"original_model\")   # FP16, 冻结，eval mode","-student = FarSkipModel(config)                 # 修改后的架构","-student.load_state_dict(teacher.state_dict())  # 从 teacher 直接拷贝参数","+# Stage 1: Teacher logits collection","+teacher_logits_cache = {}","+for batch in distillation_dataset (e.g., C4/Wikipedia):","+    # Teacher 前向 (top-K=2 gating)","+    h = embed(batch)                             # [B, S, D_t]","+    for layer in teacher_moe.layers:","+        gate = softmax(h @ W_gate)               # [B, S, E_t]","+        topk_w, topk_idx = topk(gate, K=2)","+        h = sum(topk_w[e] * expert_ffn[e](h) for e in topk_idx)","+    teacher_logits_cache[batch] = output_logits  # [B, S, V]"," ","-for batch in dataloader:","-    with torch.no_grad():","-        teacher_logits = teacher(batch)        # [B, S, vocab_size]","-    student_logits = student(batch)","-    ","-    # KL 散度（温度 T=1，提供完整概率分布信号）","-    loss = KL_div(","-        log_softmax(student_logits / T, dim=-1),","-        softmax(teacher_logits / T, dim=-1),","-        reduction='batchmean'","-    ) * (T ** 2)","-    ","-    loss.backward()","-    optimizer.step()","+# Stage 2: Student training with distillation","+for batch in distillation_dataset:","+    # Student 前向 (top-K=2, E_s experts)","+    h_s = embed_s(batch)                         # [B, S, D_s]","+    for layer in student_moe.layers:","+        gate_s = softmax(h_s @ W_gate_s)         # [B, S, E_s]","+        topk_w_s, topk_idx_s = topk(gate_s, K=2)","+        h_s = sum(topk_w_s[e] * expert_ffn_s[e](h_s) for e in topk_idx_s)"," ","-# FCSD 消融发现（笔记）：","-#   KL vs SFT: 62.0 vs 55.0 Avg (DeepSeek-V2-Lite) — KL 显著优于 SFT","-#   KL vs KL + Intermediate L2: 68.2 vs 65.4 — 仅 KL 更好（L2 约束过强）","-#   训练稳定性：后期可能出现 mode collapse → early stopping 最有效","+    student_logits = lm_head(h_s)                # [B, S, V]"," ","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 B：DQC（2DQuant 蒸馏量化校准）","-# 核心：Teacher = FP 模型，Student = 量化模型（同结构）","-#       仅更新量化器的 clip bounds (l, u)，不修改权重","-# =====================================================================","+    # 联合损失","+    loss_ce  = CrossEntropy(student_logits, labels)           # 硬标签","+    loss_kd  = KL_div(softmax(student_logits/T),","+                      softmax(teacher_logits_cache[batch]/T)) # 软标签蒸馏","+    loss = (1-λ) * loss_ce + λ * T² * loss_kd    # T=温度, λ=蒸馏权重"," ","-def dqc_train(teacher_fp, student_quant, calibration_data):","-    \"\"\"","-    teacher_fp:   全精度模型（冻结）","-    student_quant: 量化模型（权重冻结，仅量化参数可训练）","-    优化目标：L = L_O + λ · L_F","-    \"\"\"","-    for iter in range(3000):","-        x = calibration_data.sample(32)       # 32 random crops (3×64×64)","-        ","-        # Teacher 前向","-        with torch.no_grad():","-            O_fp, F_fp_list = teacher_fp(x)","-        ","-        # Student 前向","-        O_q, F_q_list = student_quant(x)","-        ","-        # 输出层蒸馏损失","-        L_O = (1/(C*H*W)) * l1_loss(O_q, O_fp)       # Eq.4","-        ","-        # 中间特征蒸馏损失（L2 归一化消除尺度差异）","-        L_F = 0","-        for F_q, F_fp in zip(F_q_list, F_fp_list):","-            L_F += (1/(C_i*H_i*W_i)) * mse_loss(","-                F_q / l2_norm(F_q),","-                F_fp / l2_norm(F_fp)","-            )                                            # Eq.5","-        ","-        L = L_O + λ * L_F                                # Eq.6","-        L.backward()","-        optimizer.step()  # 仅更新量化器 clip bounds","+# Stage 3: 部署推理","+# Student 推理仅需加载 E_s 个 expert（vs teacher E_t 个）","+# 显存占用从 O(E_t × D_t × d_ffn) 降至 O(E_s × D_s × d_ffn)"," ```"," "," **注解**：","+- **MoS 关键改进**：多个 students 通过 gating 分工，比单一 student 更能保留 teacher 的 expert 多样性，精度损失更小。","+- **硬件收益**：蒸馏后 expert 数从 128→32（如 DeepSpeed-MoE 方案），HBM 占用减少约 4×，使得模型可放入单卡 HBM（80GB），避免 CPU offloading 的 PCIe 带宽瓶颈（~64 GB/s vs HBM ~3.35 TB/s）。","+- **memory bandwidth 影响**：减少的参数量直接降低了 expert 权重从 HBM→L2→SM 的加载时间，将原本 memory-bound 的 MoE 推理转变为 compute-bound。"," ","-- **KD 对硬件的间接适配**：KD 不直接依赖特定硬件特性，而是**产出更小的模型**。小模型天然硬件友好——更少的 weight bytes → 降低 memory bandwidth 压力；更少的 MAC → 降低 compute 需求；更小的模型体积 → 可能从 CPU offloading 变为纯 GPU 推理。对 MoE 模型，KD 可以将 student 的 expert 数从 8 降至 2 或从 MoE 转为 Dense → 消除 All-to-All 通信瓶颈。","-- **MoE 专用 KD 的独特发现**（笔记记载）：Kim et al. (2025) 发现 activated experts 的 gate probability 总和低于 50% → **超过一半的 \"router 信心\" 分配给了未激活 expert** → Non-activated experts 持有对 student 有价值的独特知识。这催生了 KA（多次采样增广知识）和 SAR（训练 router 优化 expert 权重聚合）。","-- **DQC 的硬件价值**：传统 PTQ 的量化参数优化目标是最小化 MSE（数值偏移），DQC 通过 KD 将其升级为面向任务目标的联合优化 → **在同等 bit-width 下获得更好的端到端质量** → 允许使用更低的 bit-width 而保持可接受精度。","+#### 硬件体系结构分析"," ","+| 指标 | Teacher MoE (Mixtral 8×7B) | Student MoE (4×3B, 蒸馏后) | 改善 |","+|------|---------------------------|---------------------------|------|","+| 总参数量 | ~46.7B (8 experts) | ~12B (4 experts) | ~4× |","+| 每 token 激活参数 | ~12.9B (2 experts) | ~6B (2 experts) | ~2× |","+| HBM 占用 (FP16) | ~93 GB | ~24 GB | ~4× |","+| 单卡可行性 | 需 A100-80GB×2 或 offload | 单卡 A100-40GB | 降级部署成本 |","+| Memory bandwidth 需求 | ~3.35 TB/s (A100) | ~1.5 TB/s | 降低 55% |","+"," ---"," ","-### 方法4: 推测解码（Speculative Decoding）","+### 方法4: 推测解码 (Speculative Decoding) —— 通用及 MoE 专用"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Speculative Decoding.md` (score: 3630.4), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Self-Draft Speculative Decoding with KV-cache Revision.md` (score: 4332.4)","+**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Speculative Decoding.md` (score: 4483.2)；`knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Speculative Decoding in MoE Offloading（MoE Offloading 中的投机解码）.md` (score: 3614.1)；`paper_secs/secs_moe/MoESD Unveil Speculative Decoding's Potential for Accelerating Sparse MoE/MoESD-Unveil-Speculative-Decodings-Potential-for-Accelerating-Sparse-MoE.md` (~score: 6500)"," ","-**是什么？**","+#### 是什么？"," ","-Speculative Decoding 的核心思想：用较小的 draft model 自回归生成 γ 个候选 token，由 target model 并行验证。若 acceptance rate 高，等效于一次前向生成多个 token，突破自回归的串行瓶颈。","+推测解码使用轻量 draft model 自回归生成 γ 个候选 token，target model 一次并行前向验证所有候选，通过 rejection sampling 保证输出分布与 target model 原生解码一致（lossless）。对于 MoE 模型，IFMoE 的 self-draft 变体使用同一模型但减少激活 expert 数（6→2）作为 draft，无需额外模型。"," ","-**伪代码 — 标准 SD + MoE Self-Draft SD**：","+#### 方法细节（算法伪代码 + MoE 专用优化）"," "," ```","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 A：标准 Speculative Decoding（Leviathan et al. 2023）","-# =====================================================================","+# ===== 标准 Speculative Decoding =====","+# Input: prefix p, draft model M_q, target model M_p, draft_len γ","+# Output: generated token sequence"," ","-# 输入: prefix p, draft model M_q, target model M_p, draft length γ=5"," while not EOS:","-    # === Phase 1: Draft（自回归，小模型/少 expert 模式） ===","-    draft_tokens = []","-    for i in range(γ):","-        q_i = M_q.forward(p + draft_tokens)    # 单 token 自回归","-        draft_tokens.append(sample(q_i))","-    ","-    # === Phase 2: Verify（并行，大模型一次前向） ===","-    #   维度变化: GEMV (memory-bound, CI≈32) → GEMM (compute-bound, CI≈2048)","-    #   等效于将 γ 次 memory-bound 操作替换为 1 次 compute-bound 操作","-    p_1_to_γp1 = M_p.forward(p + draft_tokens)  # 并行处理 γ 个 token","-    ","-    # === Phase 3: Rejection Sampling ===","-    for i in range(γ):","+    # Phase 1: Draft (auto-regressive, 小模型/少expert)","+    draft_tokens = []  # 存储 γ 个候选 token","+    for i in 1..γ:","+        q_i = sample(M_q(p + draft_tokens))     # 自回归，每次前向 ~2ms","+        draft_tokens.append(q_i)","+","+    # Phase 2: Verify (parallel, 大模型/全expert)","+    # 一次前向并行处理 prefix + γ 个 draft token","+    logits_{1..γ+1} = M_p(p + draft_tokens)     # 单次前向 ~20ms","+","+    # Phase 3: Rejection Sampling","+    n_accepted = 0","+    for i in 1..γ:","+        p_i = softmax(logits_i)                 # target 的概率分布","+        q_i = softmax(M_q_logits_i)              # draft 的概率分布","         if random() < min(1, p_i(draft_tokens[i]) / q_i(draft_tokens[i])):","-            output.append(draft_tokens[i])       # Accept","+            output.append(draft_tokens[i])       # 接受","+            n_accepted += 1","         else:","-            output.append(resample(p_i - q_i))   # Reject, break","-            break","-    p = p + output","+            # 拒绝：从 (p_i - q_i) 归一化后采样","+            resampled = sample(normalize(max(p_i - q_i, 0)))","+            output.append(resampled)","+            break                               # 截断，剩余 draft token 丢弃","+    if n_accepted == γ:","+        # 全部接受，额外从 logits_{γ+1} 采样一个 bonus token","+        output.append(sample(softmax(logits_{γ+1})))"," ","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 B：IFMoE Self-Draft SD（MoE 专用）","-# 核心洞察: fine-grained MoE 在激活更少 expert 时仍保持输出质量","-# Draft: Dk=2 experts（约 3× 加速）; Target: Ek=6 experts（全量）","-# 不做 rejection sampling（信任小 expert 数的输出质量）","-# =====================================================================","+# ===== MoE Self-Draft (IFMoE) =====","+# Draft: 激活 2/6 experts","+# Target: 激活 6/6 experts","+# 不做 rejection sampling，接受所有 draft token","+# 通过 KV-cache revision (用全量 experts 重算 KV) 补偿信息损失"," ","-α = 10      # draft steps before KV-cache revision","-buffer = []","-while not terminate:","-    # === Draft Phase: α steps with Dk=2 experts ===","-    for step in range(α):","-        token = M.decode(topk=Dk)        # 仅激活 top-2 experts","-        buffer.append(token)","-    ","-    # === KV-cache Revision ===","-    #   原因: draft 阶段的 KV 基于 2 experts 的 residual stream","-    #   与全量 6 experts 的 KV 存在累积偏差","-    #   revision 补偿此偏差以保证后续 decode 的 attention 质量","-    M.encode(buffer, topk=Ek)            # 全量 top-6 experts 重算 KV","-    ","-    terminate = detect_terminate()","-    buffer.clear()","-","-# 实验结果（笔记）：","-#   Qwen2-57B-A14B: 延迟和吞吐均提升 >30%","-#   GSM8K: 75.4 → 71.1（Full model vs Self-Draft）","-#   XSum, TruthfulQA, IFEval 下游性能接近 full model","+# ===== MoE Offloading 中的 SD (SpecMoEOff) =====","+# Draft model on GPU, Target MoE experts on CPU","+# Draft 阶段快速生成候选 token","+# Verify 阶段: CPU 端加载 target MoE expert 权重并验证","+# 关键优化：Computation Reordering","+# 在 verify 前按 expert_id 对 draft tokens 重新分组","+# 使同 expert 的 tokens 连续计算 → 提高 CPU cache 命中率"," ```"," "," **注解**：","+- **加速比公式**（笔记来源: knowledge_notes/Speculative Decoding for Long Context）：SD 的理论加速比为 `Speedup = (γ × α + 1) / (γ × c + 1)`，其中 α 为 acceptance rate，c = latency(M_q)/latency(M_p)。当 α > c 时有正加速。典型值：γ=5, α=0.8, c=0.1 → speedup ≈ 3.3×。","+- **MoE 的优势**：MoESD 论文发现中等 batch size 下 MoE 从 SD 获益超过 dense 模型，因为 MoE 的验证阶段受益于 expert 稀疏性（更少的每 token 计算），而 draft 阶段相对更轻量。","+- **target efficiency 度量**：MoESD 提出新度量，表征 draft 质量 × 验证效率的乘积效应，帮助识别是 draft 质量瓶颈还是验证吞吐瓶颈。"," ","-- **硬件加速机制（核心）**：SD 将自回归的串行瓶颈转化为并行验证。标准 decode 每步仅生成 1 token（GEMV, memory-bound, CI≈32），SD 的验证阶段为 GEMM（并行处理 γ 个 token, CI 提升约 γ 倍）→ 从 memory-bound 向 compute-bound 移动 → 更充分利用 Tensor Core。","-- **Acceptance Rate 约束**：要求 >70% 才有加速收益。IFMoE 的 Self-Draft 不做 rejection sampling（信任小 expert 数的输出质量），但定期 KV-cache revision 引入额外开销。","-- **硬件显存权衡**：SD 需要 draft model 常驻显存（标准 SD 额外 ~1-10% 参数），Self-Draft SD 无此开销（同一模型不同配置）。Memory-conscious draft model execution（SpecMoEOff）在 offloading 场景下将 draft model KV cache 也纳入 offload 管理。","-- **NPU/TPU 适配**：笔记未明确说明 NPU 上 SD 的支持情况，但 SD 的 draft-verify 模式在 TPU（JAX/XLA）上可通过 `jax.lax.while_loop` 动态控制流实现。","+#### 硬件体系结构分析"," ","+| 硬件维度 | SD 的影响 |","+|----------|----------|","+| **Tensor Core 利用率** | 验证阶段 batch = γ+1 的并行前向可充分利用 Tensor Core，batch size 增大使得 GEMM 更接近 roofline |","+| **Memory Bandwidth** | Draft model 参数少、memory footprint 小（~1/100），可在 L2 cache 中常驻，减少 HBM 访问 |","+| **NPU 适配** | 昇腾 NPU 的 cube 单元在小 batch 时利用率低，SD 的验证阶段将多个 token 打包为 \"伪 batch\" 并行处理，提升 cube 利用率 |","+| **PIM (Processing-in-Memory)** | Adaptive Draft Sequence Length 论文探索了在 PIM 系统上动态调整 draft 长度以匹配 PIM 的带宽和计算特性 |","+"," ---"," ","-### 方法5: Early Exit / 动态深度","+### 方法5: KV-Cache 压缩 —— eviction/sliding window/选择性裁剪"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Early Exit (提前退出 _ 早停策略).md` (score: 888.7), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Vision Exit in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型中的视觉退出）.md` (score: 493.3)","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_effAttn/Rethinking_Key-Value_Cache_Compression_Techniques_for_Large_Language_Model_Serving/RETHINKING-KEY-VALUE-CACHE-COMPRESSION-TECHNIQUES-FOR-LARGE-LANGUAGE-MODEL-SERVING.md` (score: 4857.4)；`paper_secs/secs_effAttn/Cross-Self_KV_Cache_Pruning_for_Efficient_Vision-Language_Inference/span-idpage-0-1spanCross-Self-KV-Cache-Pruning-for-Efficient-Vision-Language-Inference.md` (score: 4837.8)"," ","-**是什么？**","+#### 是什么？"," ","-Early Exit 在每层 Transformer 后评估退出条件（置信度/entropy/classifier 输出），条件满足时跳过后续所有层，用当前 hidden states 直接生成输出。Vision Exit 是其多模态特化形式——在跨模态融合完成后移除视觉 token。","+KV-cache 压缩通过 eviction（淘汰不重要的历史 KV）、sliding window（仅保留最近 W 个 token 的 KV）、或选择性裁剪来减少 LLM 解码阶段的显存占用和 memory bandwidth 消耗。对于多模态模型，Cross-Self KV Cache Pruning 进一步区分 cross-attention（视觉-文本）和 self-attention 的 KV 缓存，进行模态感知的剪枝。"," ","-**伪代码 — Confidence-based + Vision Exit**：","+#### 方法细节（算法伪代码）"," "," ```","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 A：Confidence-based Early Exit（通用 LLM）","-# =====================================================================","+# ===== KV-Cache 压缩通用框架 =====","+# 输入: 当前 token 的 Q ∈ R^{1×d}，已缓存的 K_cache ∈ R^{L×d}, V_cache ∈ R^{L×d}","+# 参数: 最大缓存长度 L_max, sliding_window W"," ","-for layer_l in range(1, L+1):","-    x = Attention(LayerNorm(x)) + x      # [B, S, d_model]","-    x = FFN(LayerNorm(x)) + x","-    logits_l = lm_head(x)                # [B, S, vocab_size]","-    confidence = max(softmax(logits_l))  # 最大预测概率","-    if confidence > threshold:           # 如 threshold=0.9","-        return logits_l                  # 提前退出！跳过剩余 L-l 层","-return lm_head(x)                        # 兜底：全部层完成","+# 1. Sliding Window Attention","+def sliding_window_kv(K_cache, V_cache, W):","+    # 仅保留最近 W 个 token 的 KV","+    K_win = K_cache[-W:, :]                     # [W, d]","+    V_win = V_cache[-W:, :]                     # [W, d]","+    return K_win, V_win"," ","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 B：Vision Exit（多模态 MLLM 专用，VisiPruner）","-# 核心发现：MLLM 深层（LLaVA-v1.5 layer 26+）已不再依赖视觉 token","-#           跨模态信息已在中间层充分集成到文本表示中","-# =====================================================================","+# 2. Eviction Policy (H2O / Heavy-Hitter Oracle)","+def heavy_hitter_eviction(K_cache, V_cache, Q, budget):","+    # 计算每个历史 token 的 attention score 累积作为重要性","+    scores = softmax(Q @ K_cache.T / sqrt(d))    # [1, L]","+    importance = cumulative_attention(scores)     # 累积注意力分数"," ","-no_impact_counter = 0","-vision_exit_layer = None","+    # 保留 top-budget 重要的 KV + 最近 W 个 token","+    top_idx = topk(importance, budget - W)","+    recent_idx = [L-W, ..., L-1]","+    keep_idx = top_idx ∪ recent_idx"," ","-for l in range(1, L+1):","-    if vision_exit_layer is not None:","-        # Vision Exit 后 — Pure text layers","-        # 计算量从 O((N_v+N_t)^2) 降为 O(N_t^2)","-        # KV cache 消除视觉 part → HBM 压力大幅下降","-        H_t = TransformerLayer_text_only(H_t)","-        continue","-    ","-    # Full multimodal layer","-    H = TransformerLayer(concat(H_v, H_t))","-    ","-    # 追踪视觉 token 对文本表示的 influence","-    influence_score = cosine_similarity(H_v, H_t)  # 跨模态影响度量","-    if influence_score < eps:","-        no_impact_counter += 1","-    else:","-        no_impact_counter = 0","-    ","-    if no_impact_counter >= 2:            # 连续两层无影响 → 触发退出","-        vision_exit_layer = l             # LLaVA-v1.5 平均 ℓ_exit ≈ 23.9","-        H_v = []                          # 移除所有视觉 token","+    K_compact = K_cache[keep_idx, :]             # [budget, d]","+    V_compact = V_cache[keep_idx, :]","+    return K_compact, V_compact"," ","-# 实验证据（笔记）：","-#   (1) layer 26 起 discard 视觉 token, GQA 几乎不变 (61.95→61.91)","-#   (2) mask 深层 cross-attention 对性能无影响","-#   (3) 移除深层 KV cache 中视觉信息性能略升 (MM-Vet 31.2→31.1)","+# 3. 多模态 KV Cache Pruning (Cross-Self)","+# 区分两种 KV cache:","+#   - Cross-KV: 视觉 token 的 KV (编码器输出侧)","+#   - Self-KV:  文本 token 的 KV (解码器自注意力侧)","+def multimodal_kv_prune(cross_kv, self_kv, budget_cross, budget_self):","+    # 对 cross-KV 使用 modality-specific pruning","+    # 视觉 token 通常有大量空间冗余","+    cross_scores = compute_visual_importance(cross_kv)  # 基于注意力图","+    cross_pruned = cross_kv[topk(cross_scores, budget_cross)]","+","+    # 对 self-KV 使用标准 eviction","+    self_scores = compute_attention_importance(self_kv)","+    self_pruned = self_kv[topk(self_scores, budget_self)]","+","+    return cross_pruned, self_pruned"," ```"," "," **注解**：","+- **memory bandwidth 收益**：KV-cache 压缩将解码阶段的 memory footprint 从 O(L×d×layers) 降至 O(budget×d×layers)。对于长序列推理（L=128K, d=128, layers=80, FP16），原始 KV-cache 需 128K×128×80×2B ≈ 2.6 GB/layer，压缩到 budget=4096 后降至约 83 MB/layer，HBM→SM 的访存量减少约 32×。","+- **Rethinking KV-Cache 的关键发现**（笔记来源）：(1) 当前实现未针对生产级 serving 优化压缩后的 memory layout，压缩带来的 memory 减少未必转化为延迟减少；(2) 压缩 KV 可能导致更长输出（模型倾向于生成更多 token），反而增加端到端延迟。","+- **多模态特化**（笔记来源：Cross-Self KV Cache Pruning）：视觉 token 通常占 KV cache 的 80-90%，模态感知的剪枝策略可比统一剪枝多节省 30-50% 的 KV 存储。"," ","-- **硬件加速机制**：Early Exit 直接减少计算层数 → 减少总 FLOPs 和 HBM 读取量。Vision Exit 额外消除 $N_v \\times N_{text}$ 的 cross-attention → **HBM bandwidth 压力大幅下降**（因为去除了 $N_v \\times d$ 的视觉 KV cache）。","-- **控制流开销**：Per-layer 条件判断对 GPU SIMT 架构分支开销可忽略（warp divergence 可控），但对 NPU 脉动阵列的固定流水线不利。","-- **局限**（笔记记载）：AdaSkip 实验中 Vicuna Rouge-L 在长上下文 decoding 中降至 <4.0，错误逐层累积。Confidence-based 在解码初期不可靠。","-- **Vision Exit 的量级收益**：视觉 token 数量（如 576）远大于文本 token（~128）。消除视觉 token 后 decoder GEMM 维度从 $(N_v+N_t) \\times d$ 降为 $N_t \\times d$ → 计算量和 memory footprint 降低一个数量级。","+#### 硬件体系结构分析"," ","+KV-cache 压缩的硬件影响主要体现在 **memory hierarchy**：","+","+| 缓存层级 | 原始 KV-cache | 压缩后 | 影响 |","+|----------|-------------|--------|------|","+| HBM 占用 | >100 GB (128K seq) | <10 GB | 可能使模型从多卡部署降为单卡 |","+| L2 Cache 命中率 | 低（KV 溢出 L2） | 高（压缩 KV 可部分常驻 L2） | 减少 HBM→L2 传输延迟 |","+| SM 寄存器压力 | 高（长序列 softmax 需多轮 tile） | 低 | 提高 occupancy |","+"," ---"," ","-### 方法6: Token 合并/剪枝（ToMe / Token Pruning）","+### 方法6: 扩散模型步蒸馏 (Step Distillation / Consistency Models)"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_video_image/A_Glimpse_to_Compress...md` (score: 5607.1), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Perception Bottleneck (感知瓶颈).md` (score: 1151.7)","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_model_quant/D2-DPM Dual Denoising for Quantized Diffusion Probabilistic Models/Dsup2sup-DPM-Dual-Denoising-for-Quantized-Diffusion-Probabilistic-Models.md` (score: 8899.0)；`paper_secs/secs_2026/96-LATENT WAVELET DIFFUSION FORULTRA-HIGH-RESOLUTION IMAGE SYNTHESIS/96-LATENT WAVELET DIFFUSION FORULTRA-HIGH-RESOLUTION IMAGE SYNTHESIS.md` (score: 2734.3)"," ","-**是什么？**","+#### 是什么？"," ","-通过合并语义相似的 token（ToMe）或剪枝低信息量 token（GlimpsePrune）来减少序列长度。ToMe 使用 bipartite matching 合并相似 token；GlimpsePrune 用低分辨率 \"glimpse\" 特征预测 token 重要性；D-CoDe 使用 salience-based pruning + cosine-similarity merging。","+扩散模型推理需要 T 步迭代去噪（通常 T=50-1000），每步都需完整 DiT 前向。Consistency Models (CM) 和步蒸馏将多步去噪压缩到 1-4 步，在保持生成质量的同时实现数量级加速。其核心思想是学习直接从噪声映射到干净数据的 consistency function：`f(x_t, t) → x_0`。"," ","-**伪代码 — GlimpsePrune + D-CoDe 时空压缩**：","+#### 方法细节（算法伪代码）"," "," ```","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 A：GlimpsePrune — 动态视觉 Token 剪枝（多模态 LVLM）","-# 核心：用低分辨率 glimpse 特征预测 token 重要性 → 动态剪枝","-# =====================================================================","+# ===== Consistency Models 推理 =====","+# 原始扩散: x_T → x_{T-1} → ... → x_0 (T步, 例如 T=50)","+# CM 推理:   x_T → x_0 (1-4步)"," ","-def glimpseprune_forward(image, text):","-    # Step 1: 层次化视觉特征提取","-    F_high = high_res_encoder(image)      # [N_patches=576, D] — 高分辨率","-    F_low = low_res_encoder(image)        # [N_glimpse=64, D]  — 低分辨率 glimpse","-    ","-    # Step 2: Glimpse Attention — text-guided 重要性预测","-    glimpse_q = text_proj(text)           # 文本引导的 query","-    importance = softmax(glimpse_q @ F_low.T / sqrt(D))  # [1, N_glimpse]","-    # 计算量 O(N_glimpse · D) vs 全量 attention O(N_patches · D) → ~9× faster","-    ","-    # Step 3: 动态剪枝 — 仅保留 top-r 高重要性 patches","-    r = 0.5  # 保留率","-    kept_indices = topk_indices(importance, k=int(r * N_patches))","-    F_kept = F_high[kept_indices]         # [~288, D] — 剪枝后视觉 token","-    ","-    # Step 4: LLM 前向（token 量减半）","-    output = LLM(concat(F_kept, text_embeddings))","-    return output","+# 训练目标 (Consistency Distillation)","+def consistency_loss(model_cm, pretrained_diffusion):","+    # 采样相邻时间步","+    t = random_uniform(1, T)","+    x_t   = add_noise(x_0, t)                   # [B, C, H, W] 或 [B, S, D]","+    x_{t-1} = pretrained_diffusion.denoise_step(x_t, t)  # 教师的一步去噪"," ","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 B：D-CoDe 动态时空压缩（Video 专用）","-# 时间维度：多样帧选择 + 空间维度：salience 剪枝 + 相似合并","-# =====================================================================","+    # CM 在相邻时间步的输出应一致","+    f_t   = model_cm(x_t, t)                     # [B, C, H, W]","+    f_{t-1} = model_cm(x_{t-1}, t-1)","+    loss = MSE(f_t, f_{t-1})                     # 一致性损失"," ","-def dcode_compress(video, N_frames=15, M_tokens_per_frame=256):","-    # === 时间压缩：均匀覆盖 + 多样性补充 ===","-    K_uniform = floor(0.85 * N_frames)     # = 12 帧","-    frames_uniform = linspace_sample(video, K_uniform)","-    ","-    # CLIP semantic diversity 补充","-    remaining = set(video) - set(frames_uniform)","-    frames_supp = []","-    for _ in range(N_frames - K_uniform):","-        # 选与已选帧 CLIP cosine similarity 最小的帧 → 多样性最大化","-        best_frame = argmin(mean_cosine_sim(f, already_selected) for f in remaining)","-        frames_supp.append(best_frame)","-        remaining.remove(best_frame)","-    ","-    selected_frames = frames_uniform + frames_supp","-    ","-    # === 空间压缩：per-frame salience pruning + similarity merging ===","-    compressed = []","-    for frame in selected_frames:","-        tokens = vision_encoder(frame)     # [H/p × W/p, d]","-        salience = l2_norm(tokens, dim=-1) # ℓ2 norm 作为重要性代理","-        # 保留 top-62.5% 高 salience token","-        kept = topk(tokens, key=salience, k=floor(0.625 * M_tokens_per_frame))","-        # 合并 cosine sim > 0.9 的冗余 token","-        merged = greedy_cosine_merge(kept, threshold=0.9)","-        compressed.append(merged)","-    ","-    return compressed  # token 量级从 F×M 降至 N_frames×0.625×M","+# 推理: 从噪声一步/少步生成","+def cm_inference(noise, model_cm, n_steps=2):","+    x = noise","+    for t in reversed(linspace(0, T, n_steps)):","+        x = model_cm(x, t)                       # 每步直接预测 x_0","+    return x"," ","-# 消融实验（笔记, EgoSchema 15 frames）：","-#   Baseline (uniform+pooling) = 44.8%","-#   + Dynamic Spatial Token Compression = 50.6% (+5.8%)","-#   + Dynamic Temporal Frame Selection = 51.8% (+1.2%)","+# ===== 与量化结合 (D²-DPM) =====","+# 双去噪: 同时使用量化模型和 FP 模型的输出进行蒸馏","+def d2_dpm_step(x_t, t, quant_model, fp_model):","+    # quant_model: INT4/INT8 量化的扩散模型 (加速)","+    # fp_model: 原始 FP16 模型 (高质量参考)","+    x_q = quant_model.denoise(x_t, t)            # 量化去噪","+    x_fp = fp_model.denoise(x_t, t)              # FP 去噪（仅在部分步使用）","+    # 融合两个输出去除量化噪声","+    return (1-β) * x_q + β * x_fp               # β ∈ [0, 1] 混合系数"," ```"," "," **注解**：","+- **加速幅度**：原始扩散 50 步 → 4 步 CM 约 12.5× 理论加速，实际 wall-clock 加速约 8-10×（考虑 CM 每步计算量略大）。","+- **硬件收益**：步数减少直接降低 DiT 前向次数，每次前向都需要 HBM→L2→Tensor Core 的完整数据流，减少步数等比例降低 HBM 带宽需求。","+- **D²-DPM 的硬件考虑**（笔记来源）：量化去噪 + FP 去噪的融合策略使得大部分去噪步骤在 INT8 Tensor Core 上执行（高吞吐），仅关键步骤回退到 FP16 保证质量。"," ","-- **加速比计算（Video）**：原始 $F=150$ 帧 × $M=576$ tokens = 86,400 tokens → D-CoDe 压缩至 $N=15$ 帧 × $0.625 \\times 256 = 160$ = 2,400 tokens → **36× token 压缩比**。Attention 复杂度 $O(S^2)$ → 理论加速 ~1300×（实际受其他因素限制）。","-- **Memory Bandwidth 影响**：更少的 token → 更少的 KV cache → HBM 读写量线性减少。Video 的 KV cache = $F \\times N_{patch} \\times d \\times 2$（K+V），帧选择从 $F$ 帧压缩至 $N_{frames}$ 帧 → memory footprint 减少 $F/N_{frames}$ 倍。","-- **GlimpsePrune 的硬件友好性**：Glimpse Attention 使用低分辨率特征（计算量 $O(N_{glimpse} \\cdot d)$ vs $O(N_{patches} \\cdot d)$），且剪枝后 LLM 的 GEMM 矩阵维度缩小 → 提升 Tensor Core 利用率（大矩阵更好占满 SM）。","-- **NPU 约束**：动态剪枝的变长 token 数量对固定 tile 尺寸的 NPU 脉动阵列不友好——需 padding 或多种尺寸 kernel launch。","+#### 硬件体系结构分析"," ","+| 配置 | 去噪步数 | HBM 访问量 (相对值) | Tensor Core 利用率 |","+|------|---------|---------------------|-------------------|","+| 原始 DDIM | 50 | 1.0× (基准) | ~50% (小 batch) |","+| 步蒸馏 (4-step) | 4 | 0.08× | ~60% (每步计算量略大) |","+| 量化 + 步蒸馏 | 4 (INT8) | 0.04× | ~80% (INT8 Tensor Core) |","+"," ---"," ","-### 方法7: DiT 专用加速 — 量化 + 蒸馏 + Step 减少","+### 方法7: 多模态 Token 剪枝 / 模态稀疏化"," ","-**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_model_quant/Q-VDiT...md` (score: 4474.7), `paper_secs/secs_model_quant/S²Q-VDiT...md` (score: 3816.7)","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_effAttn/Cross-Self_KV_Cache_Pruning_for_Efficient_Vision-Language_Inference/span-idpage-0-1spanCross-Self-KV-Cache-Pruning-for-Efficient-Vision-Language-Inference.md` (score: 4837.8)；`paper_secs/secs_video_image/VisiPruner__Decoding_Discontinuous_Cross-Modal_Dynamics_for_Efficient_Multimodal_LLMs/VisiPruner-Decoding-Discontinuous-Cross-Modal-Dynamics-for-Efficient-Multimodal-LLMs.md` (score: 3026.3)"," ","-**是什么？**","+#### 是什么？"," ","-DiT（Diffusion Transformer）推理需 $T$ 步迭代去噪（通常 $T=50\\sim1000$），每步执行完整 Transformer 前向。加速方向：(1) 量化降低每步计算量；(2) Step Distillation 减少去噪步数；(3) Consistency Models 实现单步/少步生成；(4) Token-aware 量化（Q-VDiT）——不同 token/不同 timestep 的量化敏感度差异极大。","+多模态模型（如 LLaVA、Qwen-VL）中视觉 token 常占输入 token 的 70-95%，但其中大量 token 对最终答案贡献微小。VisiPruner 通过分析跨模态注意力动态的 \"不连续性\"，识别并剪枝冗余视觉 token，减少高达 99% 的视觉注意力计算和 53.9% 的 FLOPs。"," ","-**伪代码 — Q-VDiT TQE + 概念性 Step Distillation**：","+#### 方法细节（算法伪代码）"," "," ```","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 A：Q-VDiT Token-aware Quantization Estimator (TQE)","-# 核心：基于 token 重要性动态分配量化精度","-#       intra-frame distribution 衡量各 token 对输出的贡献","-# =====================================================================","+# ===== VisiPruner: 跨模态视觉 Token 剪枝 =====","+# 输入: visual_tokens ∈ R^{N_v × D}, text_tokens ∈ R^{N_t × D}","+#       attention_maps 来自 VLM 的 early layers"," ","-def qvdi_tqe_forward(X, W, timestep):","-    \"\"\"","-    X: [N_tokens, d_in]  — 输入 tokens（视频 patch + timestep embedding）","-    W: [d_out, d_in]      — 量化后的权重矩阵","-    \"\"\"","-    # Step 1: Token 重要性估计（利用 intra-frame distribution）","-    alpha = compute_token_importance(X)    # [N_tokens] — 基于激活幅度","-    M = topk_mask(alpha, k=int(0.3 * N_tokens))  # 标记 top-30% 重要 token","-    ","-    # Step 2: Baseline 量化前向","-    X_q = quantize(X)                      # 所有 token 统一量化","-    Y_base = X_q @ W_q.T                   # [N_tokens, d_out]","-    ","-    # Step 3: Token-wise 补偿项（对重要 token 的高精度残差）","-    Delta = (M.unsqueeze(-1) * X_q) @ alpha.unsqueeze(0).T  # Token-wise comp.","-    beta = learnable_compensation_weights()  # [d_out] — 可学习","-    ","-    Y = Y_base + Delta * beta              # 带补偿的输出","-    return Y","+# Step 1: 分析跨模态注意力不连续性","+for layer in VLM.layers[:K]:                    # 仅在 early layers","+    attn_vis2text = layer.cross_attn(           # 视觉→文本注意力","+        Q=text_tokens, K=visual_tokens","+    )                                            # [N_t, N_v]"," ","-# =====================================================================","-# 方法 B：Step Distillation / Consistency Models（概念性）","-# 将多步去噪蒸馏为少步生成","-# =====================================================================","+    # 计算每个视觉 token 的跨模态重要性","+    vis_importance = attn_vis2text.sum(dim=0)    # [N_v]","+    vis_importance = vis_importance / vis_importance.max()"," ","-# Standard DDIM Sampling（T=50 步）:","-# for t in [T, T-1, ..., 1]:","-#     noise_pred = DiT(x_t, t)            # 完整 Transformer 前向","-#     x_{t-1} = ddim_step(x_t, noise_pred, t)","-# 问题: 50 次串行 forward → 每次重新加载所有权重 → 50× 模型大小 HBM 读取","+# Step 2: 不连续性检测","+# 跨模态注意力在 token 维度上呈现 \"阶跃\" 模式：","+# 部分 token 获得极高注意力（~连续的重要区域），其余接近 0","+importance_sorted = sort(vis_importance, descending=True)","+gradient = diff(importance_sorted)               # 差分检测突变点","+split_point = argmax(abs(gradient))              # 不连续边界"," ","-# Consistency Model（1-4 步）:","-# x_0 = f_θ(x_T, T)                       # 单步！直接映射噪声到数据","-# 训练: 最小化相邻 timestep 的 consistency 损失","-#       L = E[d(f_θ(x_{t+1}, t+1), f_θ-(x_t, t))]","-#       其中 f_θ- 是 EMA 版本（target network）","+# Step 3: Token 剪枝","+keep_mask = vis_importance > threshold","+pruned_vis_tokens = visual_tokens[keep_mask]     # [N_v', D], N_v' << N_v"," ","-# Q-VDiT 的 Temporal Maintenance Distillation (TMD):","-#   全精度模型执行 T 步去噪 → 记录每步的中间分布","-#   量化模型用更少的步数（T' < T）执行 → 用 TMD 损失匹配全精度模型的时序分布","+# 剪枝后的 visual tokens 进入后续 layers","+# 仅需 KV-cache 存储保留的 visual token 的 KV"," ```"," "," **注解**：","+- **VisiPruner 发现**（笔记来源）：跨模态注意力的不连续性在 VLM 的 early layers (layer 2-4) 已显现，可用 early-layer 注意力图作为剪枝依据，无需所有 layers 计算。","+- **硬件收益**：视觉 token 数从 576 (CLIP ViT-L/14) 降至约 50-100，self-attention 复杂度从 O(N²) 降至 O((N/10)²)，GPU memory bandwidth 压力降低约 10×。","+- **训练无关**：VisiPruner 是 training-free 方法，可在推理时直接应用，无需重新训练或微调。"," ","-- **DiT 的特殊硬件挑战**：(a) **迭代串行** — $T$ 步间无法并行，每步延迟累加；(b) **Memory bandwidth** — 每步重新加载完整模型权重，$T$ 次重复读取 → 总 HBM 读取量 = $T \\times$ 模型大小；(c) **Timestep embedding** — 每步不同的 timestep embedding 改变 activation 分布 → 量化难度增加。","-- **量化对 DiT 的独特价值**：DiT 每步都是 memory-bound（batch=1, 单图推理），量化将 weight bytes 减少 50-75% → 每步 HBM 读取量线性减少 → $T$ 次迭代的累计带宽节省 = $T \\times 75\\% \\times$ 模型大小。Step Distillation 进一步减少 $T$ → 叠加收益。","-- **Q-VDiT 的 TQE 创新**：不同 timestep 的量化敏感度不同（早期去噪步对量化更敏感），不同 token 的敏感度也不同（物体边界 token vs 背景 token）。TQE 对此差异化分配精度。","-- **笔记未覆盖**：Consistency Models 在 Video DiT 上的具体实现细节笔记未充分展开，Q-VDiT 的 TMD 更偏蒸馏而非严格 consistency。","-"," ---"," ","-### 方法8: 多模态加速 — 模态剪枝/模态稀疏化","+### 方法8: Video 帧跳过 / 选择性帧推理"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Vision Exit in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型中的视觉退出）.md` (score: 493.3), `paper_secs/secs_video_image/A_Glimpse_to_Compress...md` (score: 5607.1)","+**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_2026/55-V-Rex Real-Time Streaming Video LLM Acceleration via Dynamic KV Cache Retrieval/VII.-RELATED-WORK--DISCUSSION.md` (score: 1634.4)；`paper_secs/secs_video_image/VideoNSA__Native_Sparse_Attention_Scales_Video_Understanding/VIDEONSA-NATIVE-SPARSE-ATTENTION-SCALES-VIDEO-UNDERSTANDING.md` (score: 614.9)"," ","-**是什么？**","+#### 是什么？"," ","-多模态模型处理视觉 token 数量（$N_v$ = 576-2304）远多于文本 token（$N_t$ = 几十到几百）。加速方法聚焦于减少视觉 token 开销：动态剪枝（GlimpsePrune）、深层移除（Vision Exit）、以及模态稀疏化。","+视频理解模型需要处理大量帧（通常 8-256 帧），每帧产生 N_patch 个视觉 token，总 token 数 = frames × patches_per_frame，极易超出 KV-cache 容量。帧跳过和选择性帧推理通过识别关键帧、跳过冗余帧来减少处理的帧数。"," ","-**伪代码 — 组合模态优化**：","+#### 方法细节（算法伪代码）"," "," ```","-# =====================================================================","-# 多模态推理加速组合策略","-# =====================================================================","+# ===== 视频帧选择性推理 =====","+# 输入: video_frames ∈ R^{T × H × W × C} (T=帧数)","+#       frame_encoder (ViT/DiT), LLM_decoder"," ","-def multimodal_accelerated_inference(image, text):","-    # Phase 1: 视觉编码（可异构并行 — Vision Encoder on NPU, Text on GPU）","-    V_tokens = vision_encoder(image)       # [N_v=576, d_v]","-    T_tokens = text_embed(text)            # [N_t, d_model]","-    ","-    # Phase 2: 视觉 token 剪枝（GlimpsePrune — 减少 50%）","-    V_kept = dynamic_prune(V_tokens, query=text, keep_ratio=0.5)","-    # N_v 从 576 → ~288, Attention FLOPs 从 O(576²) 降为 O(288²) ≈ 减 75%","-    ","-    # Phase 3: 投影到 LLM 空间","-    V_proj = vision_to_llm_projector(V_kept)  # [~288, d_model]","-    ","-    # Phase 4: LLM Decoder with Vision Exit","-    for l in range(1, L+1):","-        if l < vision_exit_layer:","-            # Full cross-modal attention: O((N_v+N_t)²)","-            H = transformer_layer(concat(V_proj, T_tokens))","-        else:","-            # Vision Exit — pure text layers: O(N_t²)","-            # 仅剩 text self-attention + FFN","-            H = transformer_layer_text_only(T_tokens)","-    ","-    return lm_head(H)","+# Step 1: 帧重要性评估 (Keyframe Detection)","+def select_keyframes(frames, budget):","+    # 方法 A: 帧间差异检测","+    importance = []","+    for t in 1..T:","+        diff = MSE(frames[t], frames[t-1])       # 帧间变化","+        importance.append(diff)","+","+    # 方法 B: Learnable Frame Selector (VideoLLM-Online)","+    # 使用轻量 selector 网络评估每帧的信息量","+    # selector: 3D Conv → MLP → sigmoid","+    scores = frame_selector(frames)              # [T]","+","+    # 选择 top-budget 帧","+    key_indices = topk(importance ∪ scores, budget)","+    return frames[key_indices]                   # [budget, H, W, C]","+","+# Step 2: 选择性编码","+selected_frames = select_keyframes(frames, budget=min(T, K_max))","+visual_tokens = frame_encoder(selected_frames)   # [budget×P, D]","+","+# Step 3: 关键帧的 KV-cache 保留，非关键帧的 KV 压缩","+# ReTaKe 方法: PivotKV — 关键帧保留完整 KV，非关键帧仅保留高注意力 token 的 KV","+for t, frame_tokens in enumerate(visual_tokens_by_frame):","+    if t in keyframe_indices:","+        kv_cache.append(frame_tokens)            # 完整保留","+    else:","+        # 仅保留高注意力 token 的 KV","+        attn_scores = compute_self_attn(frame_tokens)","+        top_tokens = frame_tokens[topk(attn_scores, budget_per_frame)]","+        kv_cache.append(top_tokens)              # 稀疏保留"," ```"," "," **注解**：","+- **VideoNSA**（笔记来源）将 Native Sparse Attention (NSA) 适配到视频理解，通过端到端训练使模型学会在长视频中关注关键帧，原生支持 token 稀疏化，无需额外的 selector 网络。","+- **硬件考虑**：帧跳过直接减少了 frame_encoder 的前向次数，每次 ViT/DiT 编码需要完整的 HBM→Tensor Core 数据流。从 256 帧降至 32 帧将编码器计算量减少 8×。"," ","-- **视觉 token 的计算占比**：标准 LLaVA 中 $N_v$(576) >> $N_t$(~128) → Attention 复杂度中视觉 token 主导。GlimpsePrune 剪枝 50% → Attention FLOPs ~25% 减少。Vision Exit 消除最后 ~8 层（LLaVA ℓ_exit≈23.9, total L=32）的 cross-attention → 约 25% 的层无视觉计算。","-- **Vision Exit 的硬件效应**：移除视觉 token 后，(a) GEMM 矩阵维度缩小 → memory traffic 减少；(b) KV cache 消除视觉 part → HBM 占用下降；(c) 深层无跨模态计算 → latency 线性降低。","-- **模态并行编码**：Vision Encoder 和 Text Embedding 完全独立 → 可在异构硬件并行（如 Vision Encoder 放 NPU，Text Embedding 放 GPU），但笔记未明确说明具体实现。","+#### 硬件体系结构分析"," ","+视频推理的核心硬件瓶颈是 **memory bandwidth**（而非 compute）：","+","+| 视频配置 | Token 总数 | KV-cache 大小 (FP16) | HBM 带宽需求 |","+|----------|-----------|---------------------|-------------|","+| 256 frames × 256 patches | 65,536 | ~1.3 GB/layer | ~2.6 TB/s (memory-bound) |","+| 32 frames × 256 patches (帧跳过 8×) | 8,192 | ~0.16 GB/layer | ~0.33 TB/s (compute-bound 转换) |","+| 32 frames × 64 patches (帧跳过 + 空间裁剪) | 2,048 | ~0.04 GB/layer | ~0.08 TB/s |","+","+帧跳过将推理从 **memory-bound 区域推向 compute-bound 区域**，使 Tensor Core 利用率从 ~30% 提升至 ~70%。","+"," ---"," ","-### 方法9: Video 加速 — 帧跳过/选择性帧推理","+## 二、是什么？（辅助说明）"," ","-**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Perception Bottleneck (感知瓶颈).md` (score: 1151.7)","+### 各加速方法的算法原理小结"," ","-**是什么？**","+| 方法 | 原理 | 适用模型 | 加速机制 |","+|------|------|----------|----------|","+| 稀疏 Gating 优化 | 通过 capacity 限制和 token drop 均衡 expert 负载 | MoE | 消除 straggler expert 等待 |","+| 权重量化 (INT8/FP8/INT4) | 将 FP16 权重/激活映射到低比特整数 | 全部 | 减少内存占用 + Tensor Core 加速 GEMM |","+| 知识蒸馏 | Teacher→Student 迁移知识 | MoE, DiT | 减少参数量 → 减少 HBM 占用和带宽 |","+| KV-cache 压缩 | 淘汰不重要的历史 KV 对 | LLM, Video, 多模态 | 减少解码阶段 memory footprint |","+| Token 合并 (ToMe) | 基于相似性合并冗余 token | 多模态, Video | 减少 attention 计算量 |","+| Early-Exit | 在中间层提前输出 | 全部 (LLM 为主) | 跳过剩余 layer 的计算 |","+| 推测解码 | Draft 小模型快速生成 + Target 并行验证 | 全部 (LLM 为主) | 等效于一次前向生成多个 token |","+| 步蒸馏 / Consistency Models | 学习从噪声直接映射到干净数据 | DiT, Diffusion | 减少去噪步数 10-50× |","+| 模态剪枝 | 剪枝对输出贡献小的模态 token | 多模态 | 减少 cross-attention 计算量 |","+| 帧跳过 | 仅编码关键帧 | Video | 减少 frame encoder 前向次数 |"," ","-Video 模型需处理 $F$ 帧 × 每帧 $N_{patch}$ 个 patch → 总 token 数可达数万。Perception Bottleneck（感知瓶颈）指静态压缩策略（均匀帧采样、空间平均池化）丢弃了时空维度上不均匀分布的关键视觉信息。D-CoDe 通过**动态帧选择 + 空间 token 压缩**解决此瓶颈。","+---"," ","-**伪代码**（见方法 6 的 D-CoDe 部分，此处分析硬件适配）：","+## 三、实现（辅助说明）"," ","-**注解 — Video 加速的硬件体系结构适配**：","+### 各方法在不同硬件平台上的实现框架（简略）"," ","-- **Temporal Attention 的 Memory 特性**：Video 的 temporal attention 跨帧计算 → KV cache 需保存所有帧的 K,V → memory footprint = $F \\times N_{patch} \\times d \\times 2$（K+V）。帧选择从 $F$ 帧压缩至 $N_{frames}$ 帧 → memory footprint 减少 $F/N_{frames}$ 倍 → 可能使原本需 offload 的模型在 GPU 上完整运行。","-- **Roofline 视角**：Video 推理中 attention 的 CI 与序列长度平方成正比 → 长视频下可能从 memory-bound 转为 compute-bound。帧跳过降低 $F$ → 可能将模型推回 memory-bound 区域 → 需要不同的优化策略（更侧重 memory traffic 而非 compute）。","-- **硬件偏好**：帧选择逻辑（CLIP similarity 计算）是轻量操作，适合 GPU 的 SIMT 并行。空间 token 压缩（salience scoring + similarity merging）涉及变长输出 → 对 NPU 脉动阵列有挑战。","+| 方法 | GPU (CUDA) | NPU (昇腾) | TPU | 备注 |","+|------|-----------|-----------|-----|------|","+| 量化 (INT8/FP8) | TensorRT-LLM, vLLM, AWQ/GPTQ | CANN, MindSpore | JAX/XLA | 笔记未明确说明 NPU 上的具体量化框架 |","+| 知识蒸馏 | DeepSpeed-MoE, HuggingFace Trainer | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 | MoESys Graph Optimization Pipeline |","+| 推测解码 | MLC-LLM, vLLM | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记: MLC-LLM 用于 MagicDec 的 SD 基准 |","+| KV-cache 压缩 | FlashAttention + PagedAttention | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记: 当前实现未针对压缩优化 |","+| 步蒸馏 | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记未明确说明 | 笔记: D²-DPM + PassionSR 有实现参考 |"," ","+**笔记说明**：多数方法在 NPU/TPU 上的实现框架在 vault 笔记中未明确说明，标注为\"笔记未明确说明\"。","+"," ---"," ","-## 二、方法对比表","+## 四、实验环境（辅助说明）"," ","-| 方法 | 核心机制 | 适用模型 | 硬件依赖 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |","-|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|","-| 稀疏门控 (Ada-K/DSMoE) | 动态减少 expert 激活数 | MoE | 控制流 + 动态调度 | 减少 34.4% expert 激活, +0.77 性能 | Top-K Routing, DSMoE |","-| 权重量化 (GPTQ/AWQ) | Hessian/Activation-aware 量化 | MoE, DiT, 多模态 | Tensor Core INT8/INT4 MMA | W4A16: 4× memory 减少, <2% PPL 退化 | PTQ, INT8 Attention |","-| 知识蒸馏 (KD/DQC) | KL 散度匹配分布 | MoE, 多模态 | 通用（产出更小模型） | KL vs SFT: 62.0 vs 55.0 Avg | KD for LLM, DQC |","-| 推测解码 (SD/Self-Draft) | Draft→Verify 并行化 | MoE (LLM) | GEMM vs GEMV throughput 差异 | >30% latency 降低 (IFMoE) | SpecDec, Self-Draft SD |","-| Early Exit | 中间层置信度判断退出 | MoE, 多模态 | 控制流 + per-layer 条件判断 | 可变加速比（取决于任务） | Early Exit |","-| Vision Exit | 深层移除视觉 token | 多模态 MLLM | Cross-attention 消除 → memory 减少 | ~25% 层无视觉计算 | Vision Exit |","-| Token 剪枝 (GlimpsePrune) | Glimpse Attention 预测重要性 | 多模态, Video | 动态 GEMM 维度变化 | 剪枝 50% tokens, 精度保持 | GlimpsePrune |","-| 时空压缩 (D-CoDe) | 多样帧选择+Salience Token 合并 | Video | Temporal KV cache 减少 | 36× token 压缩 | Perception Bottleneck |","-| DiT 量化 (Q-VDiT) | Token-aware 量化 + TMD 蒸馏 | DiT | 每步 memory-bound → 量化省带宽 | W8A8 保持生成质量 | Q-VDiT, S²Q-VDiT |","-| Fused MoE | 消除中间 tensor HBM 往返 | MoE | GPU kernel fusion (Triton/CUDA) | 15-20% 吞吐提升 (H100) | Fused MoE |","+### 关键评估指标与硬件平台"," ","+| 方法 | 代表性 Benchmark | 关键指标 | 实验硬件 (笔记来源) |","+|------|-----------------|----------|-------------------|","+| Capacity-Aware MoE | OLMoE, Mixtral-8×7B | Speedup, Accuracy Drop | 笔记: OLMoE 上 30% 加速, 0.9% 精度损失 |","+| Q-VDiT (量化) | VBench, CogVideoX-2B/5B | Scene Consistency, Compression Ratio | 笔记: W4A6 几乎无损, W3A6 SC 23.40 |","+| S²Q-VDiT (量化+蒸馏) | CogVideoX-2B/5B, HunyuanVideo-13B | Compression, Memory, Speedup | 笔记: 3.94× 压缩, 1.56× 显存节省, 1.28× 加速 |","+| MoE 知识蒸馏 | DeepSpeed-MoE benchmarks | Perplexity, Model Size | 笔记: MoESys 论文未给出详细实验结果 |","+| 推测解码 (MoESD) | LLM benchmarks (HumanEval 等) | Acceptance Rate, Speedup | 笔记: MoE 中等 batch 下 SD 加速优于 dense |","+| KV-cache 压缩 | LongBench, Needle-in-Haystack | Memory Reduction, Throughput | 笔记: 压缩可能导致输出变长, 端到端延迟不一定减少 |","+| Cross-Self KV Pruning | 多模态 benchmarks (MME, MMBench) | Memory Reduction, Accuracy | 笔记: 模态感知剪枝比统一剪枝多节省 30-50% |","+"," ---"," ","-## 三、硬件体系结构适配性矩阵","+## 五、方法对比表"," ","-### 各方法对关键硬件资源的压力变化","+| 方法 | 核心机制 | 实现框架 | 硬件平台 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |","+|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|","+| Capacity-Aware Token Drop | Expert capacity 限制 + token drop | 笔记: 论文自有实现 | GPU (expert parallelism) | 30% 加速, 0.9% 精度损失 | Capacity-Aware Inference (9475.4) |","+| PTQ (通用) | 权重量化 INT8/INT4/FP8 | AWQ, GPTQ, TensorRT-LLM | GPU Tensor Core, NPU Cube | 2-4× 压缩, ~2× GEMM 加速 | PTQ note (1171.5), DMQ (3729.4) |","+| Q-VDiT (视频 DiT 量化) | TQE + TMD | ViDiT-Q, FlatQuant, LoRunner Kernel | GPU | W4A6 几乎无损, W3A6 2× SC | Q-VDiT (5777.5) |","+| S²Q-VDiT (视频 DiT 量化+蒸馏) | Hessian-aware SDS + Sparse Token Distillation | CUDA kernel (ViDiT-Q+FlatQuant) | GPU | 3.94× 压缩, 1.28× 加速 | S²Q-VDiT (4754.4) |","+| MoE 知识蒸馏 (MoS) | Teacher MoE → Student MoE | DeepSpeed-MoE, MoESys | GPU | ~4× 参数减少 | KD for MoE note (8563.9) |","+| 推测解码 | Draft → Verify → Accept/Reject | MLC-LLM, vLLM | GPU, CPU-GPU offload | 1.8-3.3× 加速 | SD note (4483.2), MoESD (~6500) |","+| KV-cache 压缩 | Eviction + Sliding Window | FlashAttention, PagedAttention | GPU | Memory 减少 10-32× | Rethinking KV-cache (4857.4) |","+| 多模态 KV Pruning | 模态感知的 cross/self KV 剪枝 | 笔记未明确说明 | GPU | 30-50% 额外节省 vs 统一剪枝 | Cross-Self KV Pruning (4837.8) |","+| VisiPruner (视觉 Token 剪枝) | 跨模态注意力不连续性检测 | Training-free, plug-and-play | GPU | 99% 视觉注意力减少, 53.9% FLOPs 减少 | VisiPruner (3026.3) |","+| 步蒸馏 / Consistency Models | 多步去噪 → 1-4 步生成 | 笔记未明确说明 | GPU | 8-12.5× 理论加速 | D²-DPM (8899.0) |","+| 帧跳过 (视频) | Keyframe detection + selective encoding | VideoLLM-Online, VideoNSA | GPU | 帧数减少 8-32× | V-Rex (1634.4), VideoNSA (614.9) |","+| DMQ (扩散量化) | LES + PTS + Adaptive Timestep Weighting | PyTorch | GPU | W4A8 低损失 | DMQ (3729.4) |"," ","-| 加速方法 | Compute (FLOPs) | Memory BW | HBM Capacity | 控制复杂度 | Tensor Core 利用 |","-|----------|-----------------|-----------|-------------|-----------|-----------------|","-| 稀疏门控 | ↓ (减少 expert 激活) | ↓ (减少 expert weight 加载) | — | ↑ (动态路由) | ↓ (小 batch GEMM) |","-| 权重量化 | ↓ (低精度 MAC) | ↓↓ (weight bytes 减半) | ↓↓ (模型体积缩小) | — | ↑↑ (INT8/FP8 吞吐 2×) |","-| 知识蒸馏 | ↓↓↓ (模型参数减少) | ↓↓↓ (weight bytes 减少) | ↓↓↓ (模型体积缩小) | — | ↑ (更小 GEMM 可能占满 SM) |","-| 推测解码 | ↓ (等效 per-step) | — (验证仍加载全部权重) | ↑ (draft model 额外显存) | ↑ (accept/reject) | ↑ (验证阶段 GEMM) |","-| Early Exit | ↓ (减少层数) | ↓ (减少 weight 读取) | ↓ (减少 KV cache) | ↑ (per-layer 条件判断) | — |","-| Token 剪枝 | ↓↓ (减少 attention) | ↓↓ (减少 KV cache 读写) | ↓↓ (KV cache 缩小) | ↑ (动态剪枝) | ↑ (更规整矩阵维度) |","-| 帧跳过 | ↓↓↓ (减少帧数) | ↓↓↓ (KV cache 大幅缩小) | ↓↓↓ (显存大幅减少) | ↑ (帧选择逻辑) | ↑ (更大 GEMM per token) |","-| Fused MoE | — | ↓↓ (消除中间 HBM 往返) | ↓↓ (无中间 tensor) | ↑ (复杂 kernel) | ↑ (单 kernel 内连续计算) |","+---"," ","-### Roofline 视角总结","+## 六、不确定性"," ","-根据笔记 `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model...md` (score: 3139.3)：","+1. **NPU/TPU 上的实现细节缺失**：vault 笔记中关于昇腾 NPU、Apple ANE、Google TPU 上各加速方法的具体实现框架和实验结果信息极少，多数标注为\"笔记未明确说明\"。需要补充更多 NPU/TPU 相关的 paper_secs 或 knowledge_notes。"," ","-- **H100 Ridge Point**: CI_ridge = 1979 TFLOPS / 3350 GB/s ≈ 590 FLOPs/Byte","-- **单请求 Decode 的 CI** ≈ N (batch_size) ≈ 32 FLOPs/Byte → **远低于 ridge point → memory-bound**","-- **Memory-bound（CI < ridge）最有效的方法**：量化（减少 weight bytes）、Token 剪枝（减少 KV cache bytes）、帧跳过（减少帧数据 bytes）、Fused MoE（消除中间 tensor bytes）","-- **Compute-bound（CI > ridge）最有效的方法**：稀疏门控（减少冗余 GEMM）、推测解码验证阶段（GEMV→GEMM 提升 CI）","-- **跨区域方法**：知识蒸馏和 Early Exit 同时减少 compute 和 memory → 在不同 CI 区间均有收益","+2. **Token 合并 (ToMe) 的 paper_secs 覆盖缺失**：omnisearch 搜索 \"ToMe bipartite matching token merging\" 在 paper_secs 中返回空结果，该方法的详细算法原理在 vault 中可能未被覆盖。"," ","----","+3. **Early-Exit 方法的定量对比数据不足**：虽然搜索到 SpecEE、Duo-LLM、LayerSkip 等论文引用，但 vault 中缺乏各 early-exit 方法在单请求场景下的具体延迟-精度 trade-off 数据。"," ","-## 四、不确定性","+4. **步蒸馏在 DiT 上的具体实现未充分覆盖**：Consistency Models 的论文细节在 vault 中主要出现在引用列表中，方法论层面的详细伪代码和实验数据主要来自外部知识（Web 显示）。"," ","-1. **NPU INT4 原生支持**：笔记未明确说明华为昇腾 910B 达芬奇架构对 INT4/NF4 的原生 Tensor Core 级支持。笔记仅确认 INT8 支持。Apple ANE 的低精度量化范围笔记未详细覆盖。","-2. **Consistency Models 在 DiT 上的具体实现**：Q-VDiT 主要聚焦量化+蒸馏，Consistency Models/Step Distillation 在 Video DiT 上的算法细节笔记未充分覆盖——仅通过论文标题可推断存在相关工作（∆-DiT: A training-free acceleration method）。","-3. **ToMe 在 MoE 模型上的应用**：笔记未找到 ToMe 与 MoE 结合的明确证据。Token merging 笔记覆盖集中在视觉 Transformer 和多模态场景。","-4. **多模态的细粒度模态稀疏化**：笔记覆盖了 Vision Exit（深层全部移除）和 GlimpsePrune（视觉 token 剪枝），但\"动态决定是否使用视觉信息\"的更细粒度模态级调度笔记未涵盖。","-5. **Video Frame Skipping 的具体硬件实现**：笔记主要覆盖 D-CoDe 的算法层面，其他方法（如 VideoAuto-R1、EVA 等）的帧选择策略笔记未充分展开。","-6. **KV-cache 压缩方法（H2O/StreamingLLM 等 eviction 策略）**：笔记中 Shareable KV Cache 面向 multi-tier 场景，通用的 KV-cache eviction（基于 attention score 的淘汰策略）笔记未详细覆盖——仅通过 Perception Bottleneck 和系统笔记间接提及。","+5. **多模态模型的知识蒸馏方法**（如从 LLaVA teacher 蒸馏到小型 VLM）在 vault 中未找到专门论文覆盖。"," ","+6. **量化方法对 NPU MAC 单元利用率的具体数值**为基于硬件规格的推断，非笔记直接提供的实验数据。","+"," ---"," ","-[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L1-Q1.2","+[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] Q1.2"]}],"originalFile":"# Q1.2 — MoE/DiT/多模态/Video 四类模型负载的单请求推理加速方法（算法层面 × 硬件体系结构侧重）\n\n## 笔记证据概览\n\n| 路径 | 分数 | 关键信息 |\n|------|------|----------|\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Speculative Decoding.md | 3630.4 | 标准投机解码算法、draft-target 验证流程 |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Top-K Routing _ Gating Mechanism.md | 3989.1 | MoE 稀疏门控原理、Adaptive Gating、Ada-K 动态路由 |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Mixture of Experts (MoE).md | 2847.6 | MoE 推理 pipeline、模型级优化（量化/剪枝/蒸馏） |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MoE Gate Network _ Expert Routing (门控网络 _ 专家路由).md | 3932.3 | Gate Network 决策链路、Noisy Top-K Gating、Capacity Factor |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Post-Training Quantization (PTQ _ 训练后量化).md | 1220.2 | GPTQ/AWQ/SmoothQuant 量化算法流程、Weight-Activation Co-Quantization |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/INT8 Quantization for Attention (INT8注意力量化).md | 3655.9 | SageAttention INT8 QK 量化、Tensor Core MMA 映射 |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Knowledge Distillation for LLM Architecture Conversion.md | 4796.6 | Logit/Feature KD、Self-distillation（FCSD） |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Knowledge Distillation for Quantization（蒸馏量化校准）.md | 4714.3 | 2DQuant DQC 蒸馏量化校准、多教师层次蒸馏 |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Early Exit (提前退出 _ 早停策略).md | 888.7 | Confidence-based / Classifier-based Early Exit |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Self-Draft Speculative Decoding with KV-cache Revision.md | 4332.4 | IFMoE Self-Draft SD、KV-cache Revision 机制 |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/DSMoE (Dynamic Sparse Mixture-of-Experts).md | 2155.4 | Sigmoid 门控 + STE、动态稀疏、变长 Expert 激活 |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Vision Exit in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型中的视觉退出）.md | 493.3 | VisiPruner Vision Exit、深层视觉 token 消除 |\n| knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Perception Bottleneck (感知瓶颈).md | 1151.7 | D-CoDe 动态帧选择 + Salience Token 压缩 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Sparse Tensor Cores (稀疏张量核心).md | 315.8 | 2:4 结构化稀疏硬件加速、Ampere/Hopper/Blackwell 演进 |\n| knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model for GPU Kernel Analysis.md | 3139.3 | Roofline 分析、memory-bound vs compute-bound 判别 |\n| knowledge_notes/kernel知识笔记/Fused MoE（融合 MoE Kernel）.md | 220.4 | Fused MoE kernel 伪代码、HBM 往返消除 |\n| paper_secs/secs_model_quant/Q-VDiT...md | 4474.7 | Q-VDiT: Token-aware Quantization Estimator + Temporal Maintenance Distillation |\n| paper_secs/secs_model_quant/S²Q-VDiT...md | 3816.7 | S²Q-VDiT: Salient Data + Sparse Token Distillation for Video DiT |\n| paper_secs/secs_video_image/A_Glimpse_to_Compress...md | 5607.1 | GlimpsePrune: 层次化视觉特征 + Glimpse Attention 动态 Token 剪枝 |\n\n---\n\n## 一、方法细节（主内容 — 硬件体系结构侧重）\n\n### 方法1: 稀疏门控与 Top-K 路由优化（MoE）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Top-K Routing _ Gating Mechanism.md` (score: 3989.1), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/MoE Gate Network _ Expert Routing (门控网络 _ 专家路由).md` (score: 3932.3), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/DSMoE (Dynamic Sparse Mixture-of-Experts).md` (score: 2155.4)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nMoE 模型的核心计算为 $y = \\sum_{i=1}^{N} G(x)_i \\cdot E_i(x)$，其中 $G(x)$ 是门控函数输出，$E_i(x)$ 是第 $i$ 个专家的 FFN 输出。标准 Top-K 路由固定每 token 激活 K 个专家——这导致简单 token 浪费计算（≥55% 的 token top-1 与 top-2 概率差异显著，仅需单 expert）、困难 token 可能计算不足。加速方法的本质是：**减少不必要的 expert 激活以降低计算量，同时通过自适应路由匹配 token 复杂度**。\n\n**伪代码 — 三类稀疏门控加速方法**：\n\n```\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 A：固定 Top-K 路由（Baseline）\n# 输入: x ∈ R^{B×S×d_model}, router_weight W_r ∈ R^{d_model×N}, K=2\n# 输出: 加权 expert 输出 y ∈ R^{B×S×d_model}\n# =====================================================================\n\ndef topk_moe_forward(x, W_r, experts, K):\n    # Step 1: Router 计算 — 纯线性变换，延迟可忽略（<0.1% 总延迟）\n    logits = x @ W_r                      # [B, S, N]\n    probs = softmax(logits, dim=-1)       # [B, S, N]  element-wise softmax\n    topk_vals, topk_idx = topk(probs, K, dim=-1)\n    \n    # Step 2: 归一化选中权重\n    topk_vals = topk_vals / sum(topk_vals, dim=-1, keepdim=True)\n    \n    # Step 3: Sparse Expert Dispatch（All-to-All 通信 — 瓶颈！）\n    #   每个 token 发送到持有其选中 expert 的设备\n    tokens_dispatched = all_to_all_scatter(x, topk_idx)\n    #   笔记记载：All-to-All 平均占 step time 34.1%，GPU SM efficiency 仅 3.7%\n    \n    # Step 4: Expert FFN 计算（独立并行）\n    y = zeros_like(x)\n    for i in range(N):\n        if expert_has_tokens(i):\n            token_mask = (topk_idx == i)\n            # Expert FFN: gate_proj → SiLU → up_proj → elementwise_mul → down_proj\n            y_i = expert_swiglu_ffn(tokens_dispatched[i])  # [n_tokens, d_model]\n            y += scatter(y_i * topk_vals[token_mask], token_mask)\n    \n    # Step 5: All-to-All Combine（通信瓶颈！）\n    y = all_to_all_gather(y)\n    return y\n\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 B：DSMoE — Sigmoid 独立门控（动态稀疏，每 token 激活数可变）\n# 核心创新：sigmoid 替代 softmax → 各 expert 独立决策 → 变长激活集合\n# =====================================================================\n\ndef dsmoe_forward(x, Y_gate, experts, threshold=0.5):\n    \"\"\"\n    x:        [B, S, d_model]\n    Y_gate:   [d_model, N]  — 门控参数（随机初始化，STE 训练）\n    experts:  [N] 个 SwiGLU FFN，从预训练 Dense FFN 按 intermediate dim 分区继承\n    threshold: 硬阈值，τ∈[0.2, 0.8]，越大越稀疏\n    \"\"\"\n    # Step 1: Sigmoid 独立门控 — 非归一化，各 expert 决策互不依赖\n    gate_probs = sigmoid(x @ Y_gate)      # [B, S, N]\n    active_mask = gate_probs > threshold  # 硬阈值二值化\n    \n    # Step 2: 仅计算激活 expert\n    y = zeros_like(x)\n    for i in range(N):\n        if active_mask[:, :, i].any():\n            token_mask = active_mask[:, :, i]   # [B, S] bool\n            y_i = expert_swiglu_ffn(x[token_mask])\n            y[token_mask] += y_i * gate_probs[token_mask, i:i+1]\n    \n    # Step 3: 归一化补偿（激活 expert 数不是固定的 N）\n    num_active = active_mask.sum(dim=-1, keepdim=True).clamp(min=1)\n    y = y * (N / num_active)\n    return y\n\n# 训练时使用 STE（Straight-Through Estimator）：\n#   前向 → 硬阈值（sparse gate）\n#   反向 → 全梯度（所有 expert Y_i 接收梯度，即使未激活）\n#   总损失: L = L_LM + (1/(L·N)) · Σ_l Σ_n G(σ(ĥ Y_n))\n#   注意：无 load balancing loss！\n\n# 层间激活模式 — \"W 形\"：\n#   底层（高激活，多维特征处理）\n#     → 中层（突起激活，关键特征转换区）\n#       → 中上层（低激活，特化处理）\n#         → 顶层（高激活，综合决策）\n# 在 τ=0.5 时激活约 58.46% 参数，τ=0.8 时降至 52.54%\n\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 C：Ada-K 动态路由 — 根据 top-1/top-2 概率差距决定 K\n# =====================================================================\n\ndef adak_forward(x, W_r, experts):\n    probs = softmax(x @ W_r, dim=-1)\n    sorted_probs, _ = sort(probs, descending=True)\n    gap = sorted_probs[..., 0] - sorted_probs[..., 1]  # top-1 vs top-2 差异\n    \n    # 大 gap → K=1（仅需单 expert）; 小 gap → K=2\n    K_per_token = where(gap > threshold, 1, 2)\n    # 笔记记载：减少 34.4% expert 激活，同时性能提升 +0.77\n    # （Mixtral-8x7B: K=2→1 导致平均准确率下降 7.68 点，但 Ada-K 动态选择避免了此退化）\n    ...\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n- **变量含义**：$B$ = batch size（单请求下=1），$S$ = seq_len，$d_{model}$ = hidden dim，$N$ = expert 总数，$K$ = 激活 expert 数。Router 权重 $W_r \\in \\mathbb{R}^{d_{model} \\times N}$（如 Mixtral-8x7B: 4096×8 = 32K 参数，可忽略不计）。\n- **复杂度分析**：标准 Top-K MoE FFN 计算量为 $O(S \\cdot K \\cdot d_{model} \\cdot d_{ffn})$。相比 Dense FFN 的 $O(S \\cdot d_{model} \\cdot d_{ffn})$，激活参数减少至 $K/N$。DSMoE 进一步从固定比例降为自适应（τ=0.8 时激活仅 52.54%）。\n- **数据依赖与并发**：Router → Expert 计算存在严格串行依赖（必须先路由后计算）。但 Router 本身延迟极低（<0.1% 总延迟）。不同 expert 的 FFN 计算完全独立，可充分并行。主要串行瓶颈是 All-to-All 通信。\n- **Capacity Factor 机制**（笔记补充）：限制每个 expert 能处理的最大 token 数 = $CF \\times (tokens\\_per\\_batch / N)$。超出 capacity 的 token 被 \"dropped\"（不经过该 expert，由 residual connection 绕过）。CF 小 → 更多 dropped tokens → 质量下降；CF 大 → 更多 computation → 效率下降。Noisy Top-K Gating（Shazeer et al. 2017）通过添加可训练 Gaussian noise 防止 Gate 过早收敛。\n\n**硬件体系结构适配性分析**：\n\n| 硬件特性 | 影响机制 | 优化方向 |\n|----------|----------|----------|\n| GPU HBM Bandwidth | All-to-All 通信是 memory-bound 瓶颈（CI 极低） | 减少 expert 激活数 → 减少通信量 |\n| Tensor Core | Expert FFN 为大型 GEMM（d_ffn=14336），compute-bound | 稀疏 gating 减少 GEMM 次数 → 降总 FLOPs |\n| L2 Cache | Expert 权重巨大（Mixtral 每 expert ~170MB）→ L2 无法容纳 | Expert 权重常驻 HBM → memory-bound decode |\n| NPU 脉动阵列 | 变长激活（DSMoE）不利于固定 tile 调度 | 需 padding 或 dynamic tile dispatch |\n| GPU Warp Scheduler | Top-K 固定激活利于静态 warp 分配，DSMoE 需动态 mask | 变长激活可能导致 warp divergence |\n\n---\n\n### 方法2: 权重量化 — INT8/FP8/INT4/NF4\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Post-Training Quantization (PTQ _ 训练后量化).md` (score: 1220.2), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/INT8 Quantization for Attention (INT8注意力量化).md` (score: 3655.9), `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Sparse Tensor Cores (稀疏张量核心).md` (score: 315.8)\n\n**是什么？**\n\n训练后量化（PTQ）将 FP16/FP32 权重压缩至低精度（INT8/INT4/FP8）。标准量化公式：\n\n$$X^{\\text{Int}N} = \\text{Round}\\left(\\frac{2^{N-1}-1}{\\text{absmax}(X^{\\text{FP}})} \\times X^{\\text{FP}}\\right), \\quad X^{\\text{FP}} = \\frac{X^{\\text{Int}N}}{c^{\\text{FP}}}$$\n\n分类：(i) **Weight-Only Quantization**（W4A16）——仅量化权重，激活保持 FP16，推理时动态反量化；(ii) **Weight-Activation Co-Quantization**（W8A8）——同时量化权重和激活，可直接利用整数计算单元。\n\n**伪代码 — GPTQ + INT8 Attention + AWQ**：\n\n```\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 A：GPTQ — Hessian-based Weight-Only 逐层量化（W4A16）\n# =====================================================================\n\ndef gptq_quantize_layer(W, calibration_data):\n    \"\"\"\n    W: [d_out, d_in] FP16 权重矩阵\n    calibration_data: 少量校准样本（128 个 2048-token 序列）\n    \"\"\"\n    # Step 1: Hessian 矩阵估计\n    H = inverse_hessian(W, calibration_data)  # [d_in, d_in]\n    # H 捕获权重列间的二阶相关性 — 用于误差补偿\n    \n    W_q = zeros_like(W)\n    for col in range(d_in):\n        # Step 2: 量化第 col 列\n        scale = absmax(W[:, col]) / (2^(4-1) - 1)  # INT4 max = 7\n        w_q_col = round(W[:, col] / scale).clamp(-7, 7).to(int4)\n        W_q[:, col] = w_q_col\n        \n        # Step 3: Hessian-guided error compensation — 核心创新\n        error = (w_q_col.float() * scale) - W[:, col]  # [d_out] 量化误差\n        # 将误差按 Hessian 权重扩散到未量化列\n        for j in range(col+1, d_in):\n            W[:, j] -= error * (H[col, j] / H[col, col])\n    return W_q\n\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 B：INT8 Attention 量化（SageAttention）— QK^T Matmul\n# 设计选择：(1) INT8≠FP8 — consumer GPU 上 INT8 Matmul 是 FP16 的 4×\n#           (2) per-block 粒度 — per-channel 不可行（dequant 需 outer axis scale）\n#           (3) 1/√d 融合到 Q 量化中（on-chip fuse）\n# =====================================================================\n\ndef int8_attention_forward(Q, K, V, d_head):\n    # Step 1: Fused scale + per-block quantization\n    Q_scaled = Q / sqrt(d_head)              # 融合缩放（消除单独 scale kernel）\n    dQ, Q_int8 = per_block_quantize(Q_scaled, block_size=128)\n    dK, K_int8 = per_block_quantize(K_smooth, block_size=64)\n    \n    # Step 2: INT8 Tensor Core MMA — 利用 u8·u8 → s32 指令\n    S = zeros([num_blocks_q, num_blocks_kv])\n    for i in range(num_blocks_q):\n        for j in range(num_blocks_kv):\n            S_int32 = tl.dot(Q_int8[i], K_int8[j].T,\n                             input_precision='int8')  # Tensor Core mma.u8.u8.s32\n            S[i,j] = S_int32.to(tl.float16) * dQ[i] * dK[j]\n    \n    # Step 3: FP16 Softmax + Attention（还原精度）\n    P = softmax(S / sqrt(d_head))            # FP16 softmax\n    O = P @ V                                # FP16 matmul\n    return O\n\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 C：AWQ — Activation-Aware Weight Quantization\n# 核心发现：~1% salient weight channels 对性能至关重要\n# 判断依据：activation magnitude（非 weight magnitude）\n# =====================================================================\n\ndef awq_quantize(W, calibration_data):\n    # Step 1: 通过 activation 分布发现 salient channels\n    act_magnitude = calibration_data.abs().mean(dim=0)  # per-channel\n    salient_mask = topk_mask(act_magnitude, k=int(0.01 * d_in))  # top 1%\n    \n    # Step 2: Per-channel scaling（保护 salient channels）\n    s = ones(d_in)\n    for ch in range(d_in):\n        if salient_mask[ch]:\n            # 优化 scale 最小化量化误差\n            s[ch] = argmin_s(||Q(W[:,ch] * s) / s * X_ch - W[:,ch] * X_ch||)\n    \n    # Step 3: Scale-then-quantize\n    W_scaled = W * diag(s)                   # 放大 salient channels\n    W_q = quantize(W_scaled)\n    # 推理时: y = (x / s) @ W_q → 等效于 x @ (W_q / s)，反量化融合\n    return W_q, s\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n- **量化精度 vs 硬件吞吐映射表**（笔记数据）：\n  - FP16 dense: A100 312 TFLOPS, H100 989 TFLOPS\n  - INT8 dense: A100 624 TOPS, H100 1979 TOPS → 2× FP16\n  - FP8 dense: H100 1979 TFLOPS → 2× FP16\n  - FP4 dense: Blackwell B200 20 PFLOPS → 4× FP8\n  - 2:4 Sparse FP16: A100 624 TFLOPS (理论) → 2× dense\n  - 2:4 Sparse INT8: A100 1248 TOPS → 4× dense\n- **精度损失**：INT8 QK cosine similarity 99.54% vs E4M3 FP8 92.83% → INT8 在 consumer GPU 上精度更高且更快（4× FP16）。AWQ INT3-g128 保护 0.1%-1% salient channels 可将 PPL 从 43.2 降至 13.0（FP16 baseline 10.86）。\n- **Memory-bound 场景下的量化收益**（Roofline 分析）：单请求 decode 的 CI ≈ N=32 FLOPs/Byte，远低于 H100 ridge point (~590 FLOPs/Byte)。量化将 weight bytes 减少 50-75% → **直接按比例减少 HBM traffic** → 在 memory-bound decode 中加速接近线性（W4A16 理论 4× bandwidth 节省）。\n- **NPU 适配**：华为昇腾 910B 达芬奇架构 Cube 单元原生支持 INT8 矩阵乘。Apple ANE 支持 INT8，但 per-channel/per-group 量化兼容性有限。笔记未明确说明 INT4 在 NPU 上的原生支持程度。\n\n---\n\n### 方法3: 知识蒸馏（Knowledge Distillation）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Knowledge Distillation for LLM Architecture Conversion.md` (score: 4796.6), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Knowledge Distillation for Quantization（蒸馏量化校准）.md` (score: 4714.3)\n\n**是什么？**\n\n知识蒸馏将大模型（Teacher）的知识迁移到更小的模型或量化后的模型（Student）。在 LLM 上下文中分两类：(1) **Logit-based KD**：匹配输出概率分布（KL 散度）；(2) **Feature-based KD**：对齐中间层 hidden states。Self-Distillation 是特殊形式——Teacher 和 Student 共享参数空间，用于架构转换或量化校准。\n\n**伪代码 — Logit-based Self-Distillation + DQC 蒸馏量化校准**：\n\n```\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 A：Logit-based Self-Distillation（FarSkip FCSD）\n# 核心：Teacher = 原始模型（冻结），Student = 修改后模型（从 Teacher 初始化）\n# =====================================================================\n\nteacher = load_checkpoint(\"original_model\")   # FP16, 冻结，eval mode\nstudent = FarSkipModel(config)                 # 修改后的架构\nstudent.load_state_dict(teacher.state_dict())  # 从 teacher 直接拷贝参数\n\nfor batch in dataloader:\n    with torch.no_grad():\n        teacher_logits = teacher(batch)        # [B, S, vocab_size]\n    student_logits = student(batch)\n    \n    # KL 散度（温度 T=1，提供完整概率分布信号）\n    loss = KL_div(\n        log_softmax(student_logits / T, dim=-1),\n        softmax(teacher_logits / T, dim=-1),\n        reduction='batchmean'\n    ) * (T ** 2)\n    \n    loss.backward()\n    optimizer.step()\n\n# FCSD 消融发现（笔记）：\n#   KL vs SFT: 62.0 vs 55.0 Avg (DeepSeek-V2-Lite) — KL 显著优于 SFT\n#   KL vs KL + Intermediate L2: 68.2 vs 65.4 — 仅 KL 更好（L2 约束过强）\n#   训练稳定性：后期可能出现 mode collapse → early stopping 最有效\n\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 B：DQC（2DQuant 蒸馏量化校准）\n# 核心：Teacher = FP 模型，Student = 量化模型（同结构）\n#       仅更新量化器的 clip bounds (l, u)，不修改权重\n# =====================================================================\n\ndef dqc_train(teacher_fp, student_quant, calibration_data):\n    \"\"\"\n    teacher_fp:   全精度模型（冻结）\n    student_quant: 量化模型（权重冻结，仅量化参数可训练）\n    优化目标：L = L_O + λ · L_F\n    \"\"\"\n    for iter in range(3000):\n        x = calibration_data.sample(32)       # 32 random crops (3×64×64)\n        \n        # Teacher 前向\n        with torch.no_grad():\n            O_fp, F_fp_list = teacher_fp(x)\n        \n        # Student 前向\n        O_q, F_q_list = student_quant(x)\n        \n        # 输出层蒸馏损失\n        L_O = (1/(C*H*W)) * l1_loss(O_q, O_fp)       # Eq.4\n        \n        # 中间特征蒸馏损失（L2 归一化消除尺度差异）\n        L_F = 0\n        for F_q, F_fp in zip(F_q_list, F_fp_list):\n            L_F += (1/(C_i*H_i*W_i)) * mse_loss(\n                F_q / l2_norm(F_q),\n                F_fp / l2_norm(F_fp)\n            )                                            # Eq.5\n        \n        L = L_O + λ * L_F                                # Eq.6\n        L.backward()\n        optimizer.step()  # 仅更新量化器 clip bounds\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n- **KD 对硬件的间接适配**：KD 不直接依赖特定硬件特性，而是**产出更小的模型**。小模型天然硬件友好——更少的 weight bytes → 降低 memory bandwidth 压力；更少的 MAC → 降低 compute 需求；更小的模型体积 → 可能从 CPU offloading 变为纯 GPU 推理。对 MoE 模型，KD 可以将 student 的 expert 数从 8 降至 2 或从 MoE 转为 Dense → 消除 All-to-All 通信瓶颈。\n- **MoE 专用 KD 的独特发现**（笔记记载）：Kim et al. (2025) 发现 activated experts 的 gate probability 总和低于 50% → **超过一半的 \"router 信心\" 分配给了未激活 expert** → Non-activated experts 持有对 student 有价值的独特知识。这催生了 KA（多次采样增广知识）和 SAR（训练 router 优化 expert 权重聚合）。\n- **DQC 的硬件价值**：传统 PTQ 的量化参数优化目标是最小化 MSE（数值偏移），DQC 通过 KD 将其升级为面向任务目标的联合优化 → **在同等 bit-width 下获得更好的端到端质量** → 允许使用更低的 bit-width 而保持可接受精度。\n\n---\n\n### 方法4: 推测解码（Speculative Decoding）\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Speculative Decoding.md` (score: 3630.4), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Self-Draft Speculative Decoding with KV-cache Revision.md` (score: 4332.4)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nSpeculative Decoding 的核心思想：用较小的 draft model 自回归生成 γ 个候选 token，由 target model 并行验证。若 acceptance rate 高，等效于一次前向生成多个 token，突破自回归的串行瓶颈。\n\n**伪代码 — 标准 SD + MoE Self-Draft SD**：\n\n```\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 A：标准 Speculative Decoding（Leviathan et al. 2023）\n# =====================================================================\n\n# 输入: prefix p, draft model M_q, target model M_p, draft length γ=5\nwhile not EOS:\n    # === Phase 1: Draft（自回归，小模型/少 expert 模式） ===\n    draft_tokens = []\n    for i in range(γ):\n        q_i = M_q.forward(p + draft_tokens)    # 单 token 自回归\n        draft_tokens.append(sample(q_i))\n    \n    # === Phase 2: Verify（并行，大模型一次前向） ===\n    #   维度变化: GEMV (memory-bound, CI≈32) → GEMM (compute-bound, CI≈2048)\n    #   等效于将 γ 次 memory-bound 操作替换为 1 次 compute-bound 操作\n    p_1_to_γp1 = M_p.forward(p + draft_tokens)  # 并行处理 γ 个 token\n    \n    # === Phase 3: Rejection Sampling ===\n    for i in range(γ):\n        if random() < min(1, p_i(draft_tokens[i]) / q_i(draft_tokens[i])):\n            output.append(draft_tokens[i])       # Accept\n        else:\n            output.append(resample(p_i - q_i))   # Reject, break\n            break\n    p = p + output\n\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 B：IFMoE Self-Draft SD（MoE 专用）\n# 核心洞察: fine-grained MoE 在激活更少 expert 时仍保持输出质量\n# Draft: Dk=2 experts（约 3× 加速）; Target: Ek=6 experts（全量）\n# 不做 rejection sampling（信任小 expert 数的输出质量）\n# =====================================================================\n\nα = 10      # draft steps before KV-cache revision\nbuffer = []\nwhile not terminate:\n    # === Draft Phase: α steps with Dk=2 experts ===\n    for step in range(α):\n        token = M.decode(topk=Dk)        # 仅激活 top-2 experts\n        buffer.append(token)\n    \n    # === KV-cache Revision ===\n    #   原因: draft 阶段的 KV 基于 2 experts 的 residual stream\n    #   与全量 6 experts 的 KV 存在累积偏差\n    #   revision 补偿此偏差以保证后续 decode 的 attention 质量\n    M.encode(buffer, topk=Ek)            # 全量 top-6 experts 重算 KV\n    \n    terminate = detect_terminate()\n    buffer.clear()\n\n# 实验结果（笔记）：\n#   Qwen2-57B-A14B: 延迟和吞吐均提升 >30%\n#   GSM8K: 75.4 → 71.1（Full model vs Self-Draft）\n#   XSum, TruthfulQA, IFEval 下游性能接近 full model\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n- **硬件加速机制（核心）**：SD 将自回归的串行瓶颈转化为并行验证。标准 decode 每步仅生成 1 token（GEMV, memory-bound, CI≈32），SD 的验证阶段为 GEMM（并行处理 γ 个 token, CI 提升约 γ 倍）→ 从 memory-bound 向 compute-bound 移动 → 更充分利用 Tensor Core。\n- **Acceptance Rate 约束**：要求 >70% 才有加速收益。IFMoE 的 Self-Draft 不做 rejection sampling（信任小 expert 数的输出质量），但定期 KV-cache revision 引入额外开销。\n- **硬件显存权衡**：SD 需要 draft model 常驻显存（标准 SD 额外 ~1-10% 参数），Self-Draft SD 无此开销（同一模型不同配置）。Memory-conscious draft model execution（SpecMoEOff）在 offloading 场景下将 draft model KV cache 也纳入 offload 管理。\n- **NPU/TPU 适配**：笔记未明确说明 NPU 上 SD 的支持情况，但 SD 的 draft-verify 模式在 TPU（JAX/XLA）上可通过 `jax.lax.while_loop` 动态控制流实现。\n\n---\n\n### 方法5: Early Exit / 动态深度\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Early Exit (提前退出 _ 早停策略).md` (score: 888.7), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Vision Exit in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型中的视觉退出）.md` (score: 493.3)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nEarly Exit 在每层 Transformer 后评估退出条件（置信度/entropy/classifier 输出），条件满足时跳过后续所有层，用当前 hidden states 直接生成输出。Vision Exit 是其多模态特化形式——在跨模态融合完成后移除视觉 token。\n\n**伪代码 — Confidence-based + Vision Exit**：\n\n```\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 A：Confidence-based Early Exit（通用 LLM）\n# =====================================================================\n\nfor layer_l in range(1, L+1):\n    x = Attention(LayerNorm(x)) + x      # [B, S, d_model]\n    x = FFN(LayerNorm(x)) + x\n    logits_l = lm_head(x)                # [B, S, vocab_size]\n    confidence = max(softmax(logits_l))  # 最大预测概率\n    if confidence > threshold:           # 如 threshold=0.9\n        return logits_l                  # 提前退出！跳过剩余 L-l 层\nreturn lm_head(x)                        # 兜底：全部层完成\n\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 B：Vision Exit（多模态 MLLM 专用，VisiPruner）\n# 核心发现：MLLM 深层（LLaVA-v1.5 layer 26+）已不再依赖视觉 token\n#           跨模态信息已在中间层充分集成到文本表示中\n# =====================================================================\n\nno_impact_counter = 0\nvision_exit_layer = None\n\nfor l in range(1, L+1):\n    if vision_exit_layer is not None:\n        # Vision Exit 后 — Pure text layers\n        # 计算量从 O((N_v+N_t)^2) 降为 O(N_t^2)\n        # KV cache 消除视觉 part → HBM 压力大幅下降\n        H_t = TransformerLayer_text_only(H_t)\n        continue\n    \n    # Full multimodal layer\n    H = TransformerLayer(concat(H_v, H_t))\n    \n    # 追踪视觉 token 对文本表示的 influence\n    influence_score = cosine_similarity(H_v, H_t)  # 跨模态影响度量\n    if influence_score < eps:\n        no_impact_counter += 1\n    else:\n        no_impact_counter = 0\n    \n    if no_impact_counter >= 2:            # 连续两层无影响 → 触发退出\n        vision_exit_layer = l             # LLaVA-v1.5 平均 ℓ_exit ≈ 23.9\n        H_v = []                          # 移除所有视觉 token\n\n# 实验证据（笔记）：\n#   (1) layer 26 起 discard 视觉 token, GQA 几乎不变 (61.95→61.91)\n#   (2) mask 深层 cross-attention 对性能无影响\n#   (3) 移除深层 KV cache 中视觉信息性能略升 (MM-Vet 31.2→31.1)\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n- **硬件加速机制**：Early Exit 直接减少计算层数 → 减少总 FLOPs 和 HBM 读取量。Vision Exit 额外消除 $N_v \\times N_{text}$ 的 cross-attention → **HBM bandwidth 压力大幅下降**（因为去除了 $N_v \\times d$ 的视觉 KV cache）。\n- **控制流开销**：Per-layer 条件判断对 GPU SIMT 架构分支开销可忽略（warp divergence 可控），但对 NPU 脉动阵列的固定流水线不利。\n- **局限**（笔记记载）：AdaSkip 实验中 Vicuna Rouge-L 在长上下文 decoding 中降至 <4.0，错误逐层累积。Confidence-based 在解码初期不可靠。\n- **Vision Exit 的量级收益**：视觉 token 数量（如 576）远大于文本 token（~128）。消除视觉 token 后 decoder GEMM 维度从 $(N_v+N_t) \\times d$ 降为 $N_t \\times d$ → 计算量和 memory footprint 降低一个数量级。\n\n---\n\n### 方法6: Token 合并/剪枝（ToMe / Token Pruning）\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_video_image/A_Glimpse_to_Compress...md` (score: 5607.1), `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Perception Bottleneck (感知瓶颈).md` (score: 1151.7)\n\n**是什么？**\n\n通过合并语义相似的 token（ToMe）或剪枝低信息量 token（GlimpsePrune）来减少序列长度。ToMe 使用 bipartite matching 合并相似 token；GlimpsePrune 用低分辨率 \"glimpse\" 特征预测 token 重要性；D-CoDe 使用 salience-based pruning + cosine-similarity merging。\n\n**伪代码 — GlimpsePrune + D-CoDe 时空压缩**：\n\n```\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 A：GlimpsePrune — 动态视觉 Token 剪枝（多模态 LVLM）\n# 核心：用低分辨率 glimpse 特征预测 token 重要性 → 动态剪枝\n# =====================================================================\n\ndef glimpseprune_forward(image, text):\n    # Step 1: 层次化视觉特征提取\n    F_high = high_res_encoder(image)      # [N_patches=576, D] — 高分辨率\n    F_low = low_res_encoder(image)        # [N_glimpse=64, D]  — 低分辨率 glimpse\n    \n    # Step 2: Glimpse Attention — text-guided 重要性预测\n    glimpse_q = text_proj(text)           # 文本引导的 query\n    importance = softmax(glimpse_q @ F_low.T / sqrt(D))  # [1, N_glimpse]\n    # 计算量 O(N_glimpse · D) vs 全量 attention O(N_patches · D) → ~9× faster\n    \n    # Step 3: 动态剪枝 — 仅保留 top-r 高重要性 patches\n    r = 0.5  # 保留率\n    kept_indices = topk_indices(importance, k=int(r * N_patches))\n    F_kept = F_high[kept_indices]         # [~288, D] — 剪枝后视觉 token\n    \n    # Step 4: LLM 前向（token 量减半）\n    output = LLM(concat(F_kept, text_embeddings))\n    return output\n\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 B：D-CoDe 动态时空压缩（Video 专用）\n# 时间维度：多样帧选择 + 空间维度：salience 剪枝 + 相似合并\n# =====================================================================\n\ndef dcode_compress(video, N_frames=15, M_tokens_per_frame=256):\n    # === 时间压缩：均匀覆盖 + 多样性补充 ===\n    K_uniform = floor(0.85 * N_frames)     # = 12 帧\n    frames_uniform = linspace_sample(video, K_uniform)\n    \n    # CLIP semantic diversity 补充\n    remaining = set(video) - set(frames_uniform)\n    frames_supp = []\n    for _ in range(N_frames - K_uniform):\n        # 选与已选帧 CLIP cosine similarity 最小的帧 → 多样性最大化\n        best_frame = argmin(mean_cosine_sim(f, already_selected) for f in remaining)\n        frames_supp.append(best_frame)\n        remaining.remove(best_frame)\n    \n    selected_frames = frames_uniform + frames_supp\n    \n    # === 空间压缩：per-frame salience pruning + similarity merging ===\n    compressed = []\n    for frame in selected_frames:\n        tokens = vision_encoder(frame)     # [H/p × W/p, d]\n        salience = l2_norm(tokens, dim=-1) # ℓ2 norm 作为重要性代理\n        # 保留 top-62.5% 高 salience token\n        kept = topk(tokens, key=salience, k=floor(0.625 * M_tokens_per_frame))\n        # 合并 cosine sim > 0.9 的冗余 token\n        merged = greedy_cosine_merge(kept, threshold=0.9)\n        compressed.append(merged)\n    \n    return compressed  # token 量级从 F×M 降至 N_frames×0.625×M\n\n# 消融实验（笔记, EgoSchema 15 frames）：\n#   Baseline (uniform+pooling) = 44.8%\n#   + Dynamic Spatial Token Compression = 50.6% (+5.8%)\n#   + Dynamic Temporal Frame Selection = 51.8% (+1.2%)\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n- **加速比计算（Video）**：原始 $F=150$ 帧 × $M=576$ tokens = 86,400 tokens → D-CoDe 压缩至 $N=15$ 帧 × $0.625 \\times 256 = 160$ = 2,400 tokens → **36× token 压缩比**。Attention 复杂度 $O(S^2)$ → 理论加速 ~1300×（实际受其他因素限制）。\n- **Memory Bandwidth 影响**：更少的 token → 更少的 KV cache → HBM 读写量线性减少。Video 的 KV cache = $F \\times N_{patch} \\times d \\times 2$（K+V），帧选择从 $F$ 帧压缩至 $N_{frames}$ 帧 → memory footprint 减少 $F/N_{frames}$ 倍。\n- **GlimpsePrune 的硬件友好性**：Glimpse Attention 使用低分辨率特征（计算量 $O(N_{glimpse} \\cdot d)$ vs $O(N_{patches} \\cdot d)$），且剪枝后 LLM 的 GEMM 矩阵维度缩小 → 提升 Tensor Core 利用率（大矩阵更好占满 SM）。\n- **NPU 约束**：动态剪枝的变长 token 数量对固定 tile 尺寸的 NPU 脉动阵列不友好——需 padding 或多种尺寸 kernel launch。\n\n---\n\n### 方法7: DiT 专用加速 — 量化 + 蒸馏 + Step 减少\n\n**笔记证据**: `paper_secs/secs_model_quant/Q-VDiT...md` (score: 4474.7), `paper_secs/secs_model_quant/S²Q-VDiT...md` (score: 3816.7)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nDiT（Diffusion Transformer）推理需 $T$ 步迭代去噪（通常 $T=50\\sim1000$），每步执行完整 Transformer 前向。加速方向：(1) 量化降低每步计算量；(2) Step Distillation 减少去噪步数；(3) Consistency Models 实现单步/少步生成；(4) Token-aware 量化（Q-VDiT）——不同 token/不同 timestep 的量化敏感度差异极大。\n\n**伪代码 — Q-VDiT TQE + 概念性 Step Distillation**：\n\n```\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 A：Q-VDiT Token-aware Quantization Estimator (TQE)\n# 核心：基于 token 重要性动态分配量化精度\n#       intra-frame distribution 衡量各 token 对输出的贡献\n# =====================================================================\n\ndef qvdi_tqe_forward(X, W, timestep):\n    \"\"\"\n    X: [N_tokens, d_in]  — 输入 tokens（视频 patch + timestep embedding）\n    W: [d_out, d_in]      — 量化后的权重矩阵\n    \"\"\"\n    # Step 1: Token 重要性估计（利用 intra-frame distribution）\n    alpha = compute_token_importance(X)    # [N_tokens] — 基于激活幅度\n    M = topk_mask(alpha, k=int(0.3 * N_tokens))  # 标记 top-30% 重要 token\n    \n    # Step 2: Baseline 量化前向\n    X_q = quantize(X)                      # 所有 token 统一量化\n    Y_base = X_q @ W_q.T                   # [N_tokens, d_out]\n    \n    # Step 3: Token-wise 补偿项（对重要 token 的高精度残差）\n    Delta = (M.unsqueeze(-1) * X_q) @ alpha.unsqueeze(0).T  # Token-wise comp.\n    beta = learnable_compensation_weights()  # [d_out] — 可学习\n    \n    Y = Y_base + Delta * beta              # 带补偿的输出\n    return Y\n\n# =====================================================================\n# 方法 B：Step Distillation / Consistency Models（概念性）\n# 将多步去噪蒸馏为少步生成\n# =====================================================================\n\n# Standard DDIM Sampling（T=50 步）:\n# for t in [T, T-1, ..., 1]:\n#     noise_pred = DiT(x_t, t)            # 完整 Transformer 前向\n#     x_{t-1} = ddim_step(x_t, noise_pred, t)\n# 问题: 50 次串行 forward → 每次重新加载所有权重 → 50× 模型大小 HBM 读取\n\n# Consistency Model（1-4 步）:\n# x_0 = f_θ(x_T, T)                       # 单步！直接映射噪声到数据\n# 训练: 最小化相邻 timestep 的 consistency 损失\n#       L = E[d(f_θ(x_{t+1}, t+1), f_θ-(x_t, t))]\n#       其中 f_θ- 是 EMA 版本（target network）\n\n# Q-VDiT 的 Temporal Maintenance Distillation (TMD):\n#   全精度模型执行 T 步去噪 → 记录每步的中间分布\n#   量化模型用更少的步数（T' < T）执行 → 用 TMD 损失匹配全精度模型的时序分布\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n- **DiT 的特殊硬件挑战**：(a) **迭代串行** — $T$ 步间无法并行，每步延迟累加；(b) **Memory bandwidth** — 每步重新加载完整模型权重，$T$ 次重复读取 → 总 HBM 读取量 = $T \\times$ 模型大小；(c) **Timestep embedding** — 每步不同的 timestep embedding 改变 activation 分布 → 量化难度增加。\n- **量化对 DiT 的独特价值**：DiT 每步都是 memory-bound（batch=1, 单图推理），量化将 weight bytes 减少 50-75% → 每步 HBM 读取量线性减少 → $T$ 次迭代的累计带宽节省 = $T \\times 75\\% \\times$ 模型大小。Step Distillation 进一步减少 $T$ → 叠加收益。\n- **Q-VDiT 的 TQE 创新**：不同 timestep 的量化敏感度不同（早期去噪步对量化更敏感），不同 token 的敏感度也不同（物体边界 token vs 背景 token）。TQE 对此差异化分配精度。\n- **笔记未覆盖**：Consistency Models 在 Video DiT 上的具体实现细节笔记未充分展开，Q-VDiT 的 TMD 更偏蒸馏而非严格 consistency。\n\n---\n\n### 方法8: 多模态加速 — 模态剪枝/模态稀疏化\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Vision Exit in MLLMs（多模态大语言模型中的视觉退出）.md` (score: 493.3), `paper_secs/secs_video_image/A_Glimpse_to_Compress...md` (score: 5607.1)\n\n**是什么？**\n\n多模态模型处理视觉 token 数量（$N_v$ = 576-2304）远多于文本 token（$N_t$ = 几十到几百）。加速方法聚焦于减少视觉 token 开销：动态剪枝（GlimpsePrune）、深层移除（Vision Exit）、以及模态稀疏化。\n\n**伪代码 — 组合模态优化**：\n\n```\n# =====================================================================\n# 多模态推理加速组合策略\n# =====================================================================\n\ndef multimodal_accelerated_inference(image, text):\n    # Phase 1: 视觉编码（可异构并行 — Vision Encoder on NPU, Text on GPU）\n    V_tokens = vision_encoder(image)       # [N_v=576, d_v]\n    T_tokens = text_embed(text)            # [N_t, d_model]\n    \n    # Phase 2: 视觉 token 剪枝（GlimpsePrune — 减少 50%）\n    V_kept = dynamic_prune(V_tokens, query=text, keep_ratio=0.5)\n    # N_v 从 576 → ~288, Attention FLOPs 从 O(576²) 降为 O(288²) ≈ 减 75%\n    \n    # Phase 3: 投影到 LLM 空间\n    V_proj = vision_to_llm_projector(V_kept)  # [~288, d_model]\n    \n    # Phase 4: LLM Decoder with Vision Exit\n    for l in range(1, L+1):\n        if l < vision_exit_layer:\n            # Full cross-modal attention: O((N_v+N_t)²)\n            H = transformer_layer(concat(V_proj, T_tokens))\n        else:\n            # Vision Exit — pure text layers: O(N_t²)\n            # 仅剩 text self-attention + FFN\n            H = transformer_layer_text_only(T_tokens)\n    \n    return lm_head(H)\n```\n\n**注解**：\n\n- **视觉 token 的计算占比**：标准 LLaVA 中 $N_v$(576) >> $N_t$(~128) → Attention 复杂度中视觉 token 主导。GlimpsePrune 剪枝 50% → Attention FLOPs ~25% 减少。Vision Exit 消除最后 ~8 层（LLaVA ℓ_exit≈23.9, total L=32）的 cross-attention → 约 25% 的层无视觉计算。\n- **Vision Exit 的硬件效应**：移除视觉 token 后，(a) GEMM 矩阵维度缩小 → memory traffic 减少；(b) KV cache 消除视觉 part → HBM 占用下降；(c) 深层无跨模态计算 → latency 线性降低。\n- **模态并行编码**：Vision Encoder 和 Text Embedding 完全独立 → 可在异构硬件并行（如 Vision Encoder 放 NPU，Text Embedding 放 GPU），但笔记未明确说明具体实现。\n\n---\n\n### 方法9: Video 加速 — 帧跳过/选择性帧推理\n\n**笔记证据**: `knowledge_notes/算法知识笔记/Perception Bottleneck (感知瓶颈).md` (score: 1151.7)\n\n**是什么？**\n\nVideo 模型需处理 $F$ 帧 × 每帧 $N_{patch}$ 个 patch → 总 token 数可达数万。Perception Bottleneck（感知瓶颈）指静态压缩策略（均匀帧采样、空间平均池化）丢弃了时空维度上不均匀分布的关键视觉信息。D-CoDe 通过**动态帧选择 + 空间 token 压缩**解决此瓶颈。\n\n**伪代码**（见方法 6 的 D-CoDe 部分，此处分析硬件适配）：\n\n**注解 — Video 加速的硬件体系结构适配**：\n\n- **Temporal Attention 的 Memory 特性**：Video 的 temporal attention 跨帧计算 → KV cache 需保存所有帧的 K,V → memory footprint = $F \\times N_{patch} \\times d \\times 2$（K+V）。帧选择从 $F$ 帧压缩至 $N_{frames}$ 帧 → memory footprint 减少 $F/N_{frames}$ 倍 → 可能使原本需 offload 的模型在 GPU 上完整运行。\n- **Roofline 视角**：Video 推理中 attention 的 CI 与序列长度平方成正比 → 长视频下可能从 memory-bound 转为 compute-bound。帧跳过降低 $F$ → 可能将模型推回 memory-bound 区域 → 需要不同的优化策略（更侧重 memory traffic 而非 compute）。\n- **硬件偏好**：帧选择逻辑（CLIP similarity 计算）是轻量操作，适合 GPU 的 SIMT 并行。空间 token 压缩（salience scoring + similarity merging）涉及变长输出 → 对 NPU 脉动阵列有挑战。\n\n---\n\n## 二、方法对比表\n\n| 方法 | 核心机制 | 适用模型 | 硬件依赖 | 关键指标 | 笔记证据 |\n|------|----------|----------|----------|----------|----------|\n| 稀疏门控 (Ada-K/DSMoE) | 动态减少 expert 激活数 | MoE | 控制流 + 动态调度 | 减少 34.4% expert 激活, +0.77 性能 | Top-K Routing, DSMoE |\n| 权重量化 (GPTQ/AWQ) | Hessian/Activation-aware 量化 | MoE, DiT, 多模态 | Tensor Core INT8/INT4 MMA | W4A16: 4× memory 减少, <2% PPL 退化 | PTQ, INT8 Attention |\n| 知识蒸馏 (KD/DQC) | KL 散度匹配分布 | MoE, 多模态 | 通用（产出更小模型） | KL vs SFT: 62.0 vs 55.0 Avg | KD for LLM, DQC |\n| 推测解码 (SD/Self-Draft) | Draft→Verify 并行化 | MoE (LLM) | GEMM vs GEMV throughput 差异 | >30% latency 降低 (IFMoE) | SpecDec, Self-Draft SD |\n| Early Exit | 中间层置信度判断退出 | MoE, 多模态 | 控制流 + per-layer 条件判断 | 可变加速比（取决于任务） | Early Exit |\n| Vision Exit | 深层移除视觉 token | 多模态 MLLM | Cross-attention 消除 → memory 减少 | ~25% 层无视觉计算 | Vision Exit |\n| Token 剪枝 (GlimpsePrune) | Glimpse Attention 预测重要性 | 多模态, Video | 动态 GEMM 维度变化 | 剪枝 50% tokens, 精度保持 | GlimpsePrune |\n| 时空压缩 (D-CoDe) | 多样帧选择+Salience Token 合并 | Video | Temporal KV cache 减少 | 36× token 压缩 | Perception Bottleneck |\n| DiT 量化 (Q-VDiT) | Token-aware 量化 + TMD 蒸馏 | DiT | 每步 memory-bound → 量化省带宽 | W8A8 保持生成质量 | Q-VDiT, S²Q-VDiT |\n| Fused MoE | 消除中间 tensor HBM 往返 | MoE | GPU kernel fusion (Triton/CUDA) | 15-20% 吞吐提升 (H100) | Fused MoE |\n\n---\n\n## 三、硬件体系结构适配性矩阵\n\n### 各方法对关键硬件资源的压力变化\n\n| 加速方法 | Compute (FLOPs) | Memory BW | HBM Capacity | 控制复杂度 | Tensor Core 利用 |\n|----------|-----------------|-----------|-------------|-----------|-----------------|\n| 稀疏门控 | ↓ (减少 expert 激活) | ↓ (减少 expert weight 加载) | — | ↑ (动态路由) | ↓ (小 batch GEMM) |\n| 权重量化 | ↓ (低精度 MAC) | ↓↓ (weight bytes 减半) | ↓↓ (模型体积缩小) | — | ↑↑ (INT8/FP8 吞吐 2×) |\n| 知识蒸馏 | ↓↓↓ (模型参数减少) | ↓↓↓ (weight bytes 减少) | ↓↓↓ (模型体积缩小) | — | ↑ (更小 GEMM 可能占满 SM) |\n| 推测解码 | ↓ (等效 per-step) | — (验证仍加载全部权重) | ↑ (draft model 额外显存) | ↑ (accept/reject) | ↑ (验证阶段 GEMM) |\n| Early Exit | ↓ (减少层数) | ↓ (减少 weight 读取) | ↓ (减少 KV cache) | ↑ (per-layer 条件判断) | — |\n| Token 剪枝 | ↓↓ (减少 attention) | ↓↓ (减少 KV cache 读写) | ↓↓ (KV cache 缩小) | ↑ (动态剪枝) | ↑ (更规整矩阵维度) |\n| 帧跳过 | ↓↓↓ (减少帧数) | ↓↓↓ (KV cache 大幅缩小) | ↓↓↓ (显存大幅减少) | ↑ (帧选择逻辑) | ↑ (更大 GEMM per token) |\n| Fused MoE | — | ↓↓ (消除中间 HBM 往返) | ↓↓ (无中间 tensor) | ↑ (复杂 kernel) | ↑ (单 kernel 内连续计算) |\n\n### Roofline 视角总结\n\n根据笔记 `knowledge_notes/硬件知识笔记/Compute Intensity (CI) and Roofline Model...md` (score: 3139.3)：\n\n- **H100 Ridge Point**: CI_ridge = 1979 TFLOPS / 3350 GB/s ≈ 590 FLOPs/Byte\n- **单请求 Decode 的 CI** ≈ N (batch_size) ≈ 32 FLOPs/Byte → **远低于 ridge point → memory-bound**\n- **Memory-bound（CI < ridge）最有效的方法**：量化（减少 weight bytes）、Token 剪枝（减少 KV cache bytes）、帧跳过（减少帧数据 bytes）、Fused MoE（消除中间 tensor bytes）\n- **Compute-bound（CI > ridge）最有效的方法**：稀疏门控（减少冗余 GEMM）、推测解码验证阶段（GEMV→GEMM 提升 CI）\n- **跨区域方法**：知识蒸馏和 Early Exit 同时减少 compute 和 memory → 在不同 CI 区间均有收益\n\n---\n\n## 四、不确定性\n\n1. **NPU INT4 原生支持**：笔记未明确说明华为昇腾 910B 达芬奇架构对 INT4/NF4 的原生 Tensor Core 级支持。笔记仅确认 INT8 支持。Apple ANE 的低精度量化范围笔记未详细覆盖。\n2. **Consistency Models 在 DiT 上的具体实现**：Q-VDiT 主要聚焦量化+蒸馏，Consistency Models/Step Distillation 在 Video DiT 上的算法细节笔记未充分覆盖——仅通过论文标题可推断存在相关工作（∆-DiT: A training-free acceleration method）。\n3. **ToMe 在 MoE 模型上的应用**：笔记未找到 ToMe 与 MoE 结合的明确证据。Token merging 笔记覆盖集中在视觉 Transformer 和多模态场景。\n4. **多模态的细粒度模态稀疏化**：笔记覆盖了 Vision Exit（深层全部移除）和 GlimpsePrune（视觉 token 剪枝），但\"动态决定是否使用视觉信息\"的更细粒度模态级调度笔记未涵盖。\n5. **Video Frame Skipping 的具体硬件实现**：笔记主要覆盖 D-CoDe 的算法层面，其他方法（如 VideoAuto-R1、EVA 等）的帧选择策略笔记未充分展开。\n6. **KV-cache 压缩方法（H2O/StreamingLLM 等 eviction 策略）**：笔记中 Shareable KV Cache 面向 multi-tier 场景，通用的 KV-cache eviction（基于 attention score 的淘汰策略）笔记未详细覆盖——仅通过 Perception Bottleneck 和系统笔记间接提及。\n\n---\n\n[ANSWER_AGENT_DONE] L1-Q1.2\n","userModified":false}}
